msgid "\"Newest\" means the run that entered the group last, so the helpers sort on `run_started_at` and fall back to `created_at`. A re-run keeps the `created_at` of its first attempt while re-entering the group as the newest member, and sorting on `created_at` would cancel it as the oldest."
