# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Accounting & Finance:** Handle invoicing, payments, bank reconciliation, and financial reporting. Supports multi-currency and multi-company operations."
msgstr "**Regnskabsmæssig & finansiel:** Håndtér fakturering, betalinger, bankafstemning og regnskabsaflæggelse. Understøtter multivaluta- og multivirksomhedsaktiviteter."

msgid "**Accounts, app passwords and forwards are provisioned in batches.** Each phase (create, password update, app password list, mint, retire, drop, forward script list, read, upload, activate) is one JMAP request for all accounts. A phase on the bots' app passwords or the forward scripts carries one method call per account, addressed through its `accountId` by the recovery admin, at most `STALWART_JMAP_MAX_METHOD_CALLS` (Stalwart's default `maxMethodCalls`) per request, and a refusal names the account it hit."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Accounts, app passwords and forwards are provisioned in batches.** Each phase (create, password update, app password list, mint, retire, drop, forward script list, read, upload, activate) is one JMAP request for all accounts. A phase on the bots’ app passwords or the forward scripts carries one method call per account, addressed through its ``accountId`` by the recovery admin, at most ``STALWART_JMAP_MAX_METHOD_CALLS`` (Stalwart’s default ``maxMethodCalls``) per request, and a refusal names the account it hit."
msgstr ""

