# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Auto-created accounts** reach `User::save()` through SuiteCRM's own `CreateUser` while the request is still anonymous. Since 8.10.2 that save answers `RuntimeException: Not authorized` and forces `status = Inactive`, so `files/patch/external-auth-user-create.patch` makes the stored system user the current user around the save and restores the caller's afterwards. [`files/Dockerfile`](./files/Dockerfile) applies it with `patch -F0` on the unpacked release; the image build fails once the hunk stops matching."
msgstr "**Autooprettede konti** rækkevidde `User::save()` gennem SuiteCRMegne `CreateUser` mens anmodningen stadig er anonym. Siden 8.10.2 der gemmer svar `RuntimeException: Not authorized` og kræfter `status = Inactive`, så `files/patch/external-auth-user-create.patch` gør den lagrede systembruger til den aktuelle bruger omkring gemmestedet og genopretter opkalderens bagefter. [`files/Dockerfile`](./files/Dockerfile) anvender det med `patch -F0` på udpakket udgivelse; billedet build mislykkes, når hunk stopper matchning."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Auto-created accounts** reach ``User::save()`` through SuiteCRM’s own ``CreateUser`` while the request is still anonymous. Since 8.10.2 that save answers ``RuntimeException: Not authorized`` and forces ``status = Inactive``, so ``files/patch/external-auth-user-create.patch`` makes the stored system user the current user around the save and restores the caller’s afterwards. ```files/Dockerfile`` <./files/Dockerfile>`__ applies it with ``patch -F0`` on the unpacked release; the image build fails once the hunk stops matching."
msgstr "**Autooprettede konti** rækkevidde ``User::save()`` gennem SuiteCRMegne ``CreateUser`` mens anmodningen stadig er anonym. Siden 8.10.2 der gemmer svar ``RuntimeException: Not authorized`` og kræfter ``status = Inactive``, så ``files/patch/external-auth-user-create.patch`` gør den lagrede systembruger til den aktuelle bruger omkring gemmestedet og genopretter opkalderens bagefter. ```files/Dockerfile`` <./files/Dockerfile>`__ applies it with ``patch -F0`` på udpakket udgivelse; billedet build mislykkes, når hunk stopper matchning."

