# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup/cleanup services are more reliable:** run-once flags execute earlier, user-backup is an explicit dependency, and cleanback now uses a configurable backups root and keeps the newest backups by default (force-keep=3)."
msgstr "**Backup / oprydning tjenester er mere pålidelige:** run- når flag udføres tidligere, user-backup er en eksplicit afhængighed, og cleanback bruger nu en konfigurerbar sikkerhedskopi rod og holder den nyeste sikkerhedskopi som standard (power- keep =3)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backups survive a file truncated mid-copy.** *baudolo* 7.0.2 lets the stopped checksum copy replace a live pre-copy that a writing container broke by truncating files under rsync, which used to abort the backup."
msgstr "**Backup overlever en fil, der er afkortet.** *baudolo* 7.0.2 lader den stoppede checksum kopi erstatte en live pre- copy, at en skrive container brød af truncating filer under rsync, som bruges til at afbryde backup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bans and failed logins also go to the container output** (`STALWART_BAN_TRACER`, `tasks/tracing.yml`), next to the daily log file in the data volume."
msgstr "**Baner og fejlbehæftede logins også gå til beholderen output** (`STALWART_BAN_TRACER`, `tasks/tracing.yml`), ved siden af den daglige logfil i datamængden."

