# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Clean, flat base style.** No gradients on form controls and tables, subtle elevation shadows, one radius scale, 4/8 px spacing, visible focus rings, form state shown by border and icon. Font is the `system-ui` stack; `design.font` stays configurable. The shared element styles sit in the cascade layer `infinito-design`, so an app's own design system always wins over them and keeps its contrast relations. Such an app takes the palette through its own configuration first: a theming configuration, then an in-house theme or custom CSS option. Its role stylesheet maps the app's variables only for what no in-house option reaches."
msgstr "**Ren, flad base stil.** Ingen gradienter på formstyring og borde, diskrete højdeskygger, en radius skala, 4/8 px afstand, synlige fokus ringe, form tilstand vist ved kant og ikon. Skrifttype er `system-ui` stak `design.font` forbliver konfigurerbare. De delte elementer stilarter sidde i kaskade lag `infinito-design`, så en app eget design system altid vinder over dem og holder sine kontrastforhold. Sådan en app tager paletten gennem sin egen konfiguration først: en tema konfiguration, derefter en in-house tema eller brugerdefinerede CSS mulighed. Dens rolle stylesheet kortlægger appens variabler kun for, hvad ingen in-house mulighed når."

