msgstr "**DIR_BACKUPS** (f.eks. ``/Backups``)"

msgid "**DMARC Reports:** The published `_dmarc` record sends aggregate reports (`rua`) to `<username>@<mail domain>` of the user key in `services.mailu.dmarc.rua_user` (`platform_administrator` unless the inventory names another one). That user MUST carry a `mailbox` account or a `forward` to a user that carries one and whose `email` is that mailbox (`<username>@<mail domain>`), otherwise the deploy fails before any record is written."
msgstr ""

msgid "**DMARC Reports:** The published ``_dmarc`` record sends aggregate reports (``rua``) to ``<username>@<mail domain>`` of the user key in ``services.mailu.dmarc.rua_user`` (``platform_administrator`` unless the inventory names another one). That user MUST carry a ``mailbox`` account or a ``forward`` to a user that carries one and whose ``email`` is that mailbox (``<username>@<mail domain>``), otherwise the deploy fails before any record is written."
msgstr ""

msgid "**DMARC aggregate reports go to the mailbox of ``services.stalwart.dmarc.rua_user``** (the ``platform_administrator`` user unless the inventory names another user key). The ``_dmarc`` record publishes ``rua=mailto:<username>@<mail domain>``, and a deploy whose report user carries no ``mailbox`` account fails before any record is written."
msgstr ""

msgid "**DMARC aggregate reports go to the mailbox of `services.stalwart.dmarc.rua_user`** (the `platform_administrator` user unless the inventory names another user key). The `_dmarc` record publishes `rua=mailto:<username>@<mail domain>`, and a deploy whose report user carries no `mailbox` account fails before any record is written."
