# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**DNS Plugin Installation:** Installs a matching plugin based on your configured ACME challenge method."
msgstr "**DNS- plugin- installation:** Installerer et matchende plugin baseret på din konfigurerede ACME udfordring metode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**DNS and Webroot Challenges:** Dynamically selects the correct ACME challenge method."
msgstr "**DNS og Webroot Udfordringer:** Dynamisk vælger den korrekte ACME udfordringsmetode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Daemon registration:** Only runtimes whose binary is present are written to the daemon configuration, on a bare host and inside docker-in-docker alike. A daemon pointed at an absent runtime path refuses to start, so this role installs first and re-renders the configuration afterwards."
msgstr "**Dæmonregistrering:** Kun runtimes hvis binære er til stede er skrevet til dæmonen konfiguration, på en bare vært og inde docker-in-docker. En dæmon pegede på en fraværende runtime sti nægter at starte, så denne rolle installerer først og igen gør konfigurationen bagefter."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dark mode** and customizable theme."
msgstr "**Mørk tilstand** og tilpasses tema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dark mode.** An app's native theme toggle wins. Without one, the design follows `prefers-color-scheme`. No theme toggle is injected."
msgstr "**Mørk tilstand.** En apps oprindelige tema skifter vinder. Uden en følger designet `prefers-color-scheme`. Ingen tema skifte indsprøjtes."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dashboard card:** ``web-app-dashboard`` surfaces a KIX tile pointing at the canonical URL."
msgstr "**Dashboardkort:** ``web-app-dashboard`` overflader en KIX flise peger på den kanoniske URL."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dashboard card:** `web-app-dashboard` surfaces a KIX tile pointing at the canonical URL."
msgstr "**Dashboardkort:** `web-app-dashboard` overflader en KIX flise peger på den kanoniske URL."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dashboard sign-in:** The dashboard carries a password form backed by a generated credential of this role in every deployment, because it refuses to bind to a non-loopback address while no auth provider is registered. With Keycloak deployed, the OAuth2 proxy admits the administrator and MCP groups in front of it, and an HTTPS realm adds an OIDC button beside the form."
msgstr "**Dashboard signatur- in:** Den dashboard bærer en adgangskode formular bakkes op af en genereret creditial af denne rolle i hver implementering, fordi det nægter at binde sig til en ikke-smutback adresse, mens ingen auth udbyder er registreret. Med Keycloak , OAuth2 proxy indrømmer administratoren og MCP grupper foran det, og en HTTPS rige tilføjer en OIDC knap ved siden af formularen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dashboard tile:** The application contributes a dashboard card when the platform dashboard is part of the deployment."
msgstr "**Dashboard flise:** Ansøgningen bidrager med et instrumentbræt kort, når platformen instrumentbræt er en del af indsættelsen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dashboard tile:** when ``web-app-dashboard`` is present, the graph is offered as a card pointing at this role’s canonical domain."
msgstr "**Dashboard flise:** når ``web-app-dashboard`` er til stede, grafen tilbydes som et kort, der peger på denne rolles kanoniske domæne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dashboard tile:** when `web-app-dashboard` is present, the graph is offered as a card pointing at this role's canonical domain."
msgstr "**Dashboard flise:** når `web-app-dashboard` er til stede, grafen tilbydes som et kort, der peger på denne rolles kanoniske domæne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database Composition**"
msgstr "**Databasesammensætning**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database Composition**   Leverages the `sys-stk-backend` role to stand up your containerized database (PostgreSQL, MariaDB, etc.) with backups and user management."
msgstr "**Databasesammensætning** Gennemsnit `sys-stk-backend` rolle at stå op din containerized database (PostgreSQL, MariaDB osv.) med sikkerhedskopier og brugerstyring."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database Seeding:** Introduced the * multi-database marker for cluster-aware seeding, enabling clean PostgreSQL cluster dumps and clearer seeder semantics."
msgstr "**Database Seeding:** Indledning * multi-database markør for cluster-opmærksomme såning, der muliggør ren PostgreSQL klynge lossepladser og klarere seeder semantik."

msgid "**Database is triggered by the database service.** An application gets its database exactly when it enables and shares `postgres` or `mariadb` (55 roles already declare one of them). Object storage and engines (`sys-svc-rdbms`, objstore, engine includes of `sys-stk-backend`) follow their own existing service keys the same way."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database-aware:** consumer apps seed their connection metadata into a central ``databases.csv``, so the same run can dump SQL state alongside the file payload."
msgstr "**Database-opmærksom:** forbruger apps frø deres forbindelse metadata i en central ``databases.csv``, så det samme løb kan dumpe SQL tilstand ved siden af filen nyttelast."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database-aware:** consumer apps seed their connection metadata into a central `databases.csv`, so the same run can dump SQL state alongside the file payload."
msgstr "**Database-opmærksom:** forbruger apps frø deres forbindelse metadata i en central `databases.csv`, så det samme løb kan dumpe SQL tilstand ved siden af filen nyttelast."

msgid "**Datasources** (``templates/provisioning/datasources.yml.j2``): ``Loki`` (uid ``loki``) through the shared network of the ``loki`` service bond, sending the tenant header ``X-Scope-OrgID``, and ``Prometheus`` (uid ``prometheus``) through the attached Prometheus network."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Datasources** (`templates/provisioning/datasources.yml.j2`): `Loki` (uid `loki`) through the shared network of the `loki` service bond, sending the tenant header `X-Scope-OrgID`, and `Prometheus` (uid `prometheus`) through the attached Prometheus network."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**De-dup / loop prevention.** With any future bidirectional bridge, an event mirrored A→B must not echo back B→A. v1 (one-way) sidesteps this, but the record↔event id mapping table introduced in v1 MUST be designed so a future reverse path can detect \"already mirrored\"."
msgstr "**De- dup / loop forebyggelse.** Med eventuelle fremtidige tovejsbro, en begivenhed afspejlet A → B må ikke ekko tilbage B → A. v1 (one- way) sidetrins dette, men rekord ↔ begivenhed id mapping tabel indført i v1 SKAL udformes, så en fremtidig omvendt sti kan detektere \"allerede spejlet\"."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Debug Mode**"
msgstr "**Fejlsøgningstilstand**"

msgid "**Debug Mode**   Supports a `DEBUG` flag that appends optional `console.log` statements for easier troubleshooting in staging or development."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Debug Output**: Optional `DEBUG` gives detailed variable dumps for troubleshooting. 🐛"
msgstr ""

msgid "**Debug Output**: Optional ``DEBUG`` gives detailed variable dumps for troubleshooting. 🐛"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Debugging helpers**: log formats and instructions for general and detailed troubleshooting."
msgstr "**Fejlsøgningshjælpere**: Logformater og instruktioner til generel og detaljeret fejlfinding."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized Content Sharing:** Empower users to share photos and visual content across an interoperable, federated network with enhanced privacy controls."
msgstr "**Decentraliseret indholdsdeling:** Gør det muligt for brugerne at dele billeder og visuelt indhold på tværs af et interoperabelt, føderalt netværk med forbedret kontrol af privatlivets fred."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized Network:** Connect with users across multiple instances in a federated social media ecosystem."
msgstr "**Decentrale netværk:** Tilslut med brugere på tværs af flere tilfælde i en fødeleret sociale medier økosystem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
