msgid "**End of life.** Infinito.Nexus neither maintains nor tests this role, because the deployment can neither auto-provision it nor drive it through a test: since Akaunting 3.1 every create is gated behind ``api.akaunting.com/plans/limits``, which answers 403 without an account API key, so no invoice, customer or user can be created unattended. The default ``INFINITO_LIFECYCLES`` envelope keeps the role out of every CI round. Use `ERPNext <../web-app-erpnext/README.md>`__ or `Odoo <../web-app-odoo/README.md>`__ instead; both cover the same ledger, invoicing and contact surfaces and pin the version they run. Deploy it at your own risk and take support from `akaunting.com <https://akaunting.com>`__."
msgstr "**Slut på livet.** Infinito.Nexus hverken fastholder eller tester denne rolle, fordi indsættelsen hverken kan automatisk levere den eller køre den gennem en test: da Akaunting 3.1 hver skabelse er bøjet bag ``api.akaunting.com/plans/limits``, som svarer 403 uden konto API nøgle, så ingen faktura, kunde eller bruger kan oprettes uden opsyn. Standard ``INFINITO_LIFECYCLES`` kuvert holder rollen ud af hver CI runde. Anvendelse `ERPNext <../web-app-erpnext/README.md>`__ eller `Odoo <../web-app-odoo/README.md>`__ i stedet; begge dækker den samme hovedbog, fakturering og kontaktflader og fastgør den version, de kører. Send det på egen risiko og tag støtte fra `akaunting.com <https://akaunting.com>`__."

