# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every MCP implementation ships a Playwright test.** Each role that gains an MCP surface MUST add a matching Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` that exercises its MCP surface (a server role's authenticated endpoint, a client role's configured-server list). No MCP role is considered implemented until its Playwright test is present and green."
msgstr "**Hver MCP implementering skibe en Playwright test.** Hver rolle, der får en MCP overflade SKAL tilføje en matchende Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` som træner sin MCP overflade (en serverrolles autentificerede endpoint, en klientrolles contenred- server liste). Ingen MCP rolle betragtes som gennemført, indtil dens Playwright test er til stede og grøn."

# med en bruger- vender overflade SKAL tilføje en matchende Playwright spec
# under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` der udøver addon 's adfærd (F.eks. en
# `ldapauth`/`sociallogin` login sti, a `wp-discourse` round- trip, et
# aktiveret Odoomoduls UI-indgang). Desktoproller (`desk-*`) drev ingen web
# overflade en Playwright test kunne udøve og derfor ALDRIG skib addon specs -
# flint forbyder spec filer under `desk-*` roller. For hvert web- vender rolle
# er der ingen per- addon undtagelse: en addon anses for migreret kun når dens
# Playwright spec er til stede og grøn. Integrationsindikatorer for
# tværrollemærker (At bevise to roller er faktisk forbundet) drives under en
# dedikeret **Integration- par deployeringsvariant** at co- implementerer
# begge partnerroller, og tilføjes trinvist som hver ✅ par er armeret snarere
# end alle upfront.
# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every addon ships a Playwright test.** Each addon with a user-facing surface MUST add a matching Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` that exercises that addon's behaviour (e.g. an `ldapauth`/`sociallogin` login path, a `wp-discourse` round-trip, an enabled Odoo module's UI entry point). Desktop roles (`desk-*`) drive no web surface a Playwright test could exercise and therefore NEVER ship addon specs — the lint forbids spec files under `desk-*` roles. For every web-facing role there is no per-addon exemption: an addon is considered migrated only once its Playwright spec is present and green. Cross-role integration specs (proving two roles are actually connected) run under a dedicated **integration-pair deploy variant** that co-deploys both partner roles, and are added incrementally as each ✅ pair is wired rather than all upfront."
msgstr "**Hver addon sender en Playwright test.** Hver addon med en bruger- vender overflade SKAL tilføje en matchende Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` der udøver addon 's adfærd (F.eks. en `ldapauth`/`sociallogin` login sti, a `wp-discourse` round- trip, et aktiveret Odoomoduls UI-indgang). Desktoproller (`desk-*`) drev ingen web overflade en Playwright test kunne udøve og derfor ALDRIG skib addon specs - flint forbyder spec filer under `desk-*` roller. For hvert web- vender rolle er der ingen per- addon undtagelse: en addon anses for migreret kun når dens Playwright spec er til stede og grøn. Integrationsindikatorer for tværrollemærker (At bevise to roller er faktisk forbundet) drives under en dedikeret **Integration- par deployeringsvariant** at co- implementerer begge partnerroller, og tilføjes trinvist som hver ✅ par er armeret snarere end alle upfront."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every application-side integration is a 026 addon.** A consuming role declares a `translate` consumer entry gated on the gateway's service flag and an addon that bridges it. The applications in scope are the ones the architecture names: WordPress, Moodle, Discourse, OpenProject, Nextcloud and Matrix; which of them have an upstream consumer of this API is settled under [Re-opened Decisions](#re-opened-decisions)."
msgstr "**Hver applikationsegenskablig integrering er en 026addon.** En brugerkonsumerud declared en `translate`konsumerindstillingsgated integrering og en addon der overholder det. Brugere indskrevne indskrives af arkitekturen: WordPress, Moodle, Discourse, OpenProject, Nextcloud og Matrix; hvilke af dem har en opretningskonsumer af denne API er besluttede under [Re-opendes beslutninger](#re-opened-decisions)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The ``role_id``/``secret_id`` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in ``.applied.json``, then ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` re-pins to this run’s values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. ``custom-secret-id`` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers ``500`` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Alle missioner roterer AppRole.** Den ``role_id``/``secret_id`` Det er ikke en løbetur, der er givet. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` forsøger lagerpar, falder tilbage til det par registreret i ``.applied.json``, så ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` re- pins til denne køre værdier og ødelægger den gamle SecretID. Record er skrevet sidst, så et løb, der dør halvvejs efterlader den forrige generation intakt. ``custom-secret-id`` er **ikke** idempotent - gen- writing a holded SecretariID sms ``500`` - så swap er gearet på den værdi, der har ændret sig."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The `role_id`/`secret_id` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. `tasks/01_init.yml` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in `.applied.json`, then `tasks/06_rotate.yml` re-pins to this run's values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. `custom-secret-id` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers `500` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Alle missioner roterer AppRole.** Den `role_id`/`secret_id` Det er ikke en løbetur, der er givet. `tasks/01_init.yml` forsøger lagerpar, falder tilbage til det par registreret i `.applied.json`, så `tasks/06_rotate.yml` re- pins til denne køre værdier og ødelægger den gamle SecretID. Record er skrevet sidst, så et løb, der dør halvvejs efterlader den forrige generation intakt. `custom-secret-id` er **ikke** idempotent - gen- writing a holded SecretariID sms `500` - så swap er gearet på den værdi, der har ændret sig."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every mounted volume is discarded**, not only the backed-up ones. A volume declared `backup: false` claims to be disposable; a drill that spares it never tests the claim. If its service cannot rebuild it, the health gate goes red — that is the finding, not a false alarm. The single exception is the data directory of an engine whose dump is about to be replayed: it carries the database and its role, which the deploy creates and the container does not, so wiping it would leave `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` with nothing to connect to and the drill would fail at itself instead of at a defect."
msgstr "**Hvert monteret volumen kasseres**Ikke kun de bagudrettede. Et angivet volumen `backup: false` hævder at være engangs; en boremaskine, der sparer det aldrig tester kravet. Hvis tjenesten ikke kan genopbygge den, bliver helbredsporten rød - det er resultatet, ikke en falsk alarm. Den eneste undtagelse er datafilen for en motor, hvis dumpning er ved at blive genspillet: den bærer databasen og dens rolle, som deployeringen skaber, og beholderen ikke gør, så tørre det ville forlade `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` med intet at forbinde til, og boret ville mislykkes på sig selv i stedet for på en defekt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every ref:** Role data, categories, bundles, files and TODO markers for the deployed working tree, any branch, tag or commit of core, and every branch or tag of its forks."
msgstr "**Hver dommer:** Rolledata, kategorier, bundter, filer og TODO markører for det indsatte arbejdstræer, enhver gren, mærke eller forpligtelse af kernen, og hver gren eller tag af sine gafler."

