# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First slice is dashboard-only.** The first implementation wires each agent through its web dashboard only. Chat-platform connectors (Telegram/Discord/Signal/...), which need operator-supplied bot tokens, are deferred to a follow-up and MUST NOT block the first green deploy."
msgstr "**Første stykke er dashboard- kun.** Den første implementering ledninger hver agent gennem sin web dashboard kun. Chatplatformskonnektorer (Telegram/Discord/Signal/...), som har brug for operator- leverede bot tokens, udskydes til en opfølgning og må ikke blokere den første grønne implementering."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First slice.** The first end-to-end migration is `web-app-friendica` (`ldapauth`, bridges `ldap` to `svc-db-openldap`), because it already exercises the bridge rule and the service-flag enablement path."
msgstr "**Første stykke.** Den første ende-to-end migration er `web-app-friendica` (`ldapauth`, broer `ldap` til `svc-db-openldap`), fordi det allerede udøver broreglen og service-flag enablement sti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First slice.** The first end-to-end slice is `web-app-baserow` (server) plus `web-app-openwebui` (client)."
msgstr "**Første stykke.** Den første ende-to-end skive er `web-app-baserow` (server) plus `web-app-openwebui` (klient)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First-party asset delivery:** Browsers never contact third-party CDNs directly; the deployment fetches and caches assets server-side."
msgstr "**Levering af aktiver fra første part:** Browsere aldrig kontakte tredjeparts CDN 'er direkte; implementering henter og caches aktiver serverside."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Five-distro coverage:** Supports the five default CI distros (Archlinux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora, CentOS) without duplicated task code."
msgstr "**Five- distro dækning:** Understøtter de fem standard CI-distributioner (Archlinux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora, CentOS) uden duplikeret opgavekode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed Moodle redeploy failures** by stripping the trailing slash from *CFG->wwwroot* to prevent health check issues"
msgstr "**Fixed Moodle redeployeringsfejl** ved at strippe den efterfølgende skråstreg fra *CFG - > wwwroot* at forebygge problemer med sundhedstjek"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed**"
msgstr "**Fast**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed:** OpenProject migrations stabilized (simplified migration step; preload *CustomFieldContext* before *db:migrate*). Nextcloud LDAP config hardened and incompatible apps disabled in production. XWiki extension install hardened and one time seed ensures *Main.WebHome* exists. Matomo bootstrap fails fast on root cause. TLS and CA improvements (unified self signed CA env for health services, retries for CA trust override generation, Nix TLS CA trust fix). *msmtp* improved on Fedora. OpenLDAP *python-ldap* build prerequisites and header fallback refactored; per user *password_update* policy added. Backup and ops fixes (OnlyOffice no restart during backups; backup home and ACL tasks more reliable). Container setup hardened (Fedora Docker CE CLI, dnf5 repo add, Debian buildx conflict fix, Docker readiness and SSH restart improvements)."
msgstr "**Fast:** OpenProject vandringer stabiliseret (forenklet migrationstrin; forbelastning *BrugerFieldContext* før *db: migrere*). Nextcloud LDAP config hærdede og uforenelige apps deaktiveret i produktionen. XWiki udvidelse installere hærdet og en gang frø sikrer *Main.WebHome* eksisterer. Matomo bootstrap fejler hurtigt på roden årsag. Forbedringer af TLS og CA (samlet selvsigneret CA env for sundhedstjenester, forsøg for CA trust override generation, Nix TLS CA trust fix). *msmtp* forbedret på Fedora. OpenLDAP *python- ldap* bygge forudsætninger og header fallback refaktored; per bruger *password_update* politik tilføjet. Sikkerhedskopiering og options rettelser (OnlyOffice ingen genstart under sikkerhedskopier; backup hjem og ACL opgaver mere pålidelige). Container opsætning hærdet (Fedora Docker CE CLI, dnf5 repo add, Debian buildx conflict fix, Docker parathed og SSH genstart forbedringer)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flavor selectable:** one setting switches between Code - OSS, VSCodium and the Microsoft build."
msgstr "**Flavor valgbar:** en indstillingsafbryder mellem Code - OSS, VSCodium og Microsoft bygge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Authentication:** Integrated support for OpenID Connect (OIDC) simplifies user login and enhances security."
msgstr "**Fleksibel autentificering:** Integreret understøttelse af OpenID Connect (OIDC) forenkler brugerlogin og øger sikkerheden."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Client Support:** Access Matrix services via modern web clients like Element, plus integrated Element Call and Jitsi video conferencing."
msgstr "**Fleksibel klientstøtte:** Adgang Matrix tjenester via moderne web-klienter som Element, plus integreret Element Call og Jitsi video konference."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Configuration:**"
msgstr "**Fleksibel indstilling:**"

