# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Image-level mutation (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) and their synonyms (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) still route through `ask`, so the operator reviews them before they execute."
msgstr "**Mitigation:** Image- level mutation (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) og deres synonymer (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) stillevej gennem `ask`, så operatøren gennemgår dem, før de udfører."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Targets still cannot bypass `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, or the `deny` list. A malicious target that called `rm -rf .` would be stopped by the `rm -rf*` deny rule."
msgstr "**Mitigation:** Mål kan stadig ikke omgå `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, eller `deny` Liste. Et ondsindet mål, der kaldte `rm -rf .` ville blive stoppet af `rm -rf*` Fornægte reglen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `docker run*` and its synonyms are in `ask`, so the operator reviews them (subject to Assumption 5). The `deny` list blocks `sudo*`, so direct privilege escalation via `sudo` is unavailable."
msgstr "**Mitigation:** `docker run*` og synonymerne er i `ask`, så operatøren gennemgår dem (omfattet af overtagelsen 5). `deny` listeblokke `sudo*`, så direkte rettighedsforøgelse via `sudo` er utilgængelig."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `sandbox.enabled: true` with `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` refuses to start when the backend is unavailable. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` rejects the `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` tool parameter, so there is no per-call escape."
msgstr "**Mitigation:** `sandbox.enabled: true` med `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` nægter at starte, når bagenden ikke er tilgængelig. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` afviser `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` værktøj parameter, så der er ingen per- call flugt."

