# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Opening an adapter provider's network to its clients collides with the sidecar isolation invariant.** A provider that declares the `mcp_client` overlay puts its own containers on it. The same declaration on an adapter provider would give its sidecar a second interface, and [`isolation.sh`](../../../roles/test-e2e-cli/files/shared/mcp/isolation.sh) rejects anything but exactly one, because a sidecar holding the provider's credential must reach that provider only."
msgstr "**Åbning af en adapter udbyder netværk til sine kunder kolliderer med sidevogn isolation invariant.** En udbyder, der erklærer `mcp_client` overlay sætter sine egne containere på det. Den samme erklæring på en adapter udbyder ville give sin sidevogn en anden grænseflade, og [`isolation.sh`](../../../roles/test-e2e-cli/files/shared/mcp/isolation.sh) afviser alt andet end præcis én, fordi en sidevogn, der besidder udbyderens kreditværdighed, kun skal nå denne udbyder."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Operating a deployment.** New make targets reach a single deployed application: *compose-app-exec*, *compose-app-logs* and *compose-app-restart*. Diagnostics collect the logs an application writes to a file, including from busybox containers. Health probes use a fast start cadence with a window that outlasts a real boot, so a slow starter is no longer reaped. The CSP health check accepts a status code a vhost declares instead of dropping the vhost, and gives onion vhosts a navigation budget Tor can meet."
msgstr "**Opererer en deployering.** Nye målemål når en enkelt anvendt applikation: *compose- app- exec*, *komposit- app- logs* og *compose- app- genstart*. Diagnostik indsamle logfiler en ansøgning skriver til en fil, herunder fra busybox containere. Health prober bruge en hurtig start kadence med et vindue, der udvarer en rigtig boot, så en langsom starter er ikke længere høstede. CSP sundhed check accepterer en statuskode en vhost erklærer i stedet for at droppe vhost, og giver løg vhosts en navigation budget Tor kan mødes."

msgid "**Operator role:** The ``operator`` role of `meta/rbac.yml <./meta/rbac.yml>`__ maps to the Semaphore project role ``task_runner`` in the ``Infinito.Nexus`` project. The hook grants it to every account of an ``operator`` member and revokes it from every other account, so an operator can run the stop and start templates while a non-admin account outside the group neither sees the project nor runs its templates. Only ``administrator`` members are Semaphore admins."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Operator role:** The `operator` role of [meta/rbac.yml](./meta/rbac.yml) maps to the Semaphore project role `task_runner` in the `Infinito.Nexus` project. The hook grants it to every account of an `operator` member and revokes it from every other account, so an operator can run the stop and start templates while a non-admin account outside the group neither sees the project nor runs its templates. Only `administrator` members are Semaphore admins."
