# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Stalwart mail server.** The new *web-app-stalwart* role runs SMTP, submission, IMAP, POP3, JMAP, ManageSieve, CalDAV, CardDAV and WebDAV in one server, with spam filtering, DKIM and DMARC signing and a web admin interface, plus Roundcube webmail and a ClamAV scan of incoming mail. Domains, accounts, TLS, Keycloak sign-in, DKIM keys and DNS records are provisioned through Stalwart's management API on every deploy, in compose and in swarm mode. Two silent failures are closed: a Keycloak that was still starting could leave Stalwart without single sign-on for the life of the process, and the server wrote no logs at all. Both are fixed. See [web-app-stalwart](roles/web-app-stalwart/README.md)."
msgstr "**Stalwart mail server.** Den nye *web-app-stalwart* rollekører SMTP, indsendelse, IMAP, POP3, JMAP, ManageSieve, CalDAV, CardDAV og WebDAV i én server, med spam filtrering, DCIM og DMARC signering og en web admin interface, plus Roundcube webmail og en ClamAV scanning af indgående post. Domæner, konti, TLS, Keycloak sign-in, DKIM nøgler og DNS optegnelser er afsat gennem Stalwarts ledelse API på hver deployering, i komposition og i sværm tilstand. To lydløse fejl er lukket: en Keycloak der stadig var begyndt kunne forlade Stalwart uden enkelt sign-on for livet af processen, og serveren skrev ingen logfiler overhovedet. Begge dele er ordnet. Se [web-app-stalwart](roles/web-app-stalwart/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Stalwart replaces Mailu as the default mail provider.** *MAIL_PROVIDER* now defaults to *web-app-stalwart*, and every application switches its mail settings on only while the configured provider is deployed. An inventory that keeps Mailu must set *MAIL_PROVIDER: web-app-mailu*, otherwise its applications stop sending mail. Mailu is now *deprecated*: it keeps working until it is removed, but new deployments must not adopt it, and CI no longer deploys or tests it, the mailbox import included. To move over, deploy Stalwart next to Mailu and switch on *services.stalwart.migration.import_mailu*: in compose mode the role imports every inventory account's mail from Mailu over IMAP, keeping folders, flags and dates, and re-runs skip what is already there. See [web-app-stalwart](roles/web-app-stalwart/README.md)."
msgstr "**Stalwart-erstatning Mailu som standard postudbyder.** *MAIL_PROVIDER* Nu standard til *web-app-stalwart*, og hvert program skifter sine mailindstillinger på kun mens den konfigurerede udbyder er indsat. En opgørelse, der holder Mailu must set *MAIL_PROVIDER: web-app-mailu*, ellers dens ansøgninger ophører med at sende post. Mailu er nu *forældet*: det fortsætter med at virke indtil det er fjernet, men nye installationer må ikke vedtage det, og CI ikke længere anvender eller tester det, postkassen import inkluderet. At flytte over, indsætte Stalwart ved siden af Mailu og tænd *services.stalwart.migration.import_mailu*: i komponér tilstand rollen importerer hver lagerkonto post fra Mailu over IMAP, holde mapper, flag og datoer, og re-runs springe over, hvad der allerede er der. Se [web-app-stalwart](roles/web-app-stalwart/README.md)."

