# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Token verified against the hub:** Every deploy asks the hub whether the stored token still authenticates and re-mints it when the hub rejects it, then fails the deploy if the fresh token is rejected too. A hub whose `.storage/auth` was recreated leaves a stored token pointing at a deleted refresh token, and clients would receive a 401 on every call."
msgstr "**Token verificeret mod hubben:** Hver implementering spørger hubben, om den lagrede token stadig autentificerer og re@-@ mints det, når hubben afviser det, så mislykkes deployeringen, hvis den friske token er afvist også. Et knudepunkt, hvis `.storage/auth` blev genskabt blade en gemt token peger på en slettet genopfriskning token, og kunderne ville modtage en 401 ved alle opkald."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Token verified against the hub:** Every deploy asks the hub whether the stored token still authenticates and re-mints it when the hub rejects it, then fails the deploy if the fresh token is rejected too. A hub whose ``.storage/auth`` was recreated leaves a stored token pointing at a deleted refresh token, and clients would receive a 401 on every call."
msgstr "**Token verificeret mod hubben:** Hver implementering spørger hubben, om den lagrede token stadig autentificerer og re@-@ mints det, når hubben afviser det, så mislykkes deployeringen, hvis den friske token er afvist også. Et knudepunkt, hvis ``.storage/auth`` blev genskabt blade en gemt token peger på en slettet genopfriskning token, og kunderne ville modtage en 401 ved alle opkald."

