msgid "**Variants:** [meta/variants.yml](./meta/variants.yml) defines three variants, each with `tor` on. Variant 0 enables every service but `docs` and adds `web-app-gitea` and the `deploy` block of the foreign-server deploy (see **Test variant**). Variant 1 disables every service but `docs`, whose round replays the instructions of this README. Variant 2 enables `ldap` only, so the login form binds against the directory. Variants 0 and 2 also deploy `web-app-lam`, the application the app-control specs pause and resume."
msgstr ""

