# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`allowed_consumers` creates no network edge.** A client reaches a provider only when the provider declares a `kind: mcp_client` consumer in `meta/networks.yml`, or when the client happens to declare that provider for an unrelated reason. Four of twenty providers declared the opening; the other sixteen admitted consumers they could not serve, four of them enabled. Deploying Hermes failed at its own probe with `All connection attempts failed` against `http://prometheusmcp:8080/mcp`, because `hermes` joins `[gitlab, hermes, homeassistant, litellm, moodle]` while `prometheusmcp` joins `[prometheus]` alone."
msgstr "**`allowed_consumers` skaber ingen netværkskant.** En kunde når først en udbyder, når leverandøren erklærer `kind: mcp_client` forbrugere `meta/networks.yml`, eller når kunden tilfældigvis erklærer denne udbyder af en ikke-relateret årsag. Fire ud af tyve udbydere erklærede åbningen; de andre seksten indrømmede forbrugere, de ikke kunne tjene, fire af dem aktiveret. Deploying Hermes mislykkedes på sin egen sonde med `All connection attempts failed` mod `http://prometheusmcp:8080/mcp`, fordi `hermes` slutter `[gitlab, hermes, homeassistant, litellm, moodle]` mens `prometheusmcp` slutter `[prometheus]` Alene."

