# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A static-analysis pass (added in [tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_env_keys_used.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_env_keys_used.py)) surfaced multiple roles that **declared** the `BIBER_*` env keys but never read them in the spec; the env file was prepared, the spec was never written. The most prominent example is `web-app-joomla`: it ships an OIDC variant (`plg_system_keycloak`) and an LDAP variant (core LDAP auth plugin) per [006 - Service-gated Playwright tests](README.md#archive), but the Playwright spec only exercises the admin login. A non-admin biber landing-page assertion is missing and would catch RBAC group-mapping drift introduced by 004."
msgstr "En statisk analyse pass (tilsat [tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_env_keys_used.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_env_keys_used.py)) over flere roller, der **anmeldt** i `BIBER_*` env nøgler, men aldrig læse dem i spec; env fil blev udarbejdet, spec blev aldrig skrevet. Det mest fremtrædende eksempel er: `web-app-joomla`: det sender en OIDC variant (`plg_system_keycloak`) og en LDAP variant (Kerne- LDAP- aut- plugin) per [006 - Service- gated Playwright tests](README.md#archive), men Playwright spec kun udøver admin login. En ikke-admin biber landing- side påstand mangler og ville fange RBAC group- mapping drift indført af 004."

msgid "A step reaches the next through ``nxt`` (one target) or ``branches`` (ordered ``(label, target)`` edges for a decision, ask or looping node); a terminal step has neither. ``fn`` is the node callable ``(state) -> state`` for a deterministic or decision step; a step without one compiles to a passthrough, which is also the stub a model node runs as in a unit test. A decision node writes its chosen branch label under its own id in the state; the router defaults to the first branch, so a stub run with empty state follows the forward path to a terminal. A decision may record itself through ``decide``, which writes the branch label and appends one audit record to the JSON Lines ledger the state names."
msgstr ""

msgid "A step's ``kind`` shapes its node and states what it may do:"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A stopped agent is started again on the next request with its volume re-attached. An agent serving a request is never stopped, and the idle time is re-read under the agent's lock before the stop. When a caller has lost the `agent-user` group, the broker refuses the request and stops that caller's running agent."
msgstr "En stoppet agent startes igen på den næste anmodning med sin volumen genfastgjort. En agent, der afleverer en forespørgsel, bliver aldrig stoppet, og tomgangstiden bliver genlæst under agentens lås før stop. Når en ringer har mistet `agent-user` mægleren afviser anmodningen og stopper ham, der ringer."

msgid "A string reviewed by a human in Weblate is never overwritten; the translator only suggests."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A structured secret in the prompt forces the same restriction even when the switch is on. Only unambiguous shapes count (PEM headers, `sk-`, `ghp_`, `github_pat_`, `AKIA`, `xox[bapsr]-`, `AIza`); a pattern like `password=` would match prose and teach callers to click past the refusal. This is a second lock and not the guarantee, because any such pattern has false negatives. The guarantee is that this restriction is a filter applied before any ranking: a restricted request has no remote candidate left to rank, whatever weight locality carries in decision 9."
msgstr "En struktureret hemmelighed i prompten styrker den samme begrænsning, selv når kontakten er tændt. Kun entydige figurer tæller (PEM headers `sk-`, `ghp_`, `github_pat_`, `AKIA`, `xox[bapsr]-`, `AIza`); et mønster som `password=` ville matche prosa og lære at ringe for at klikke forbi afvisningen. Dette er en anden lås og ikke garantien, fordi et sådant mønster har falske negativer. Garantien er, at denne begrænsning er et filter, der anvendes før nogen ranking: en begrænset anmodning har ingen fjern kandidat tilbage til rang, uanset vægt lokalitet bærer i beslutningen 9."

