# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An addon resolves its tarball from `MEDIAWIKI_EXT_URL_PREFIX` plus its own id and the `REL<major>_<minor>` branch matching the pinned image. An addon that declares `config.archive` in `meta/addons/<id>.yml` uses that URL instead; `AWS` does, because Extension:AWS lives at `edwardspec/mediawiki-aws-s3` rather than under `wikimedia/mediawiki-extensions-*`, and the only `REL` branch it carries is `REL1_34`."
msgstr "En addon løser sin tarball fra `MEDIAWIKI_EXT_URL_PREFIX` plus sit eget id og `REL<major>_<minor>` gren, der matcher billedet. En addon der erklærer `config.archive` til `meta/addons/<id>.yml` bruger denne URL i stedet; `AWS` gør, fordi udvidelse: AWS bor på `edwardspec/mediawiki-aws-s3` i stedet for under `wikimedia/mediawiki-extensions-*`, og den eneste `REL` gren det bærer er `REL1_34`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
