msgid "Credentials in argv: [`tasks/01_wait_for_api.yml`](tasks/01_wait_for_api.yml) (\"Wait until Stalwart leaves bootstrap mode\") and [`tasks/11_oidc_restart.yml`](tasks/11_oidc_restart.yml) pass `-u STALWART_ADMIN_USER:STALWART_ADMIN_PASSWORD` to `curl` inside `container exec`, so the recovery admin password sits in the rendered shell command (printed as `cmd` at `-vv` while `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS` is off) and in the process list of the container; [`tasks/jmap_call.yml`](tasks/jmap_call.yml) already feeds the same pair through `curl -K -` on stdin. Option: route both waits through `jmap_call.yml` or the same stdin config pattern."
msgstr "Valg i argv: [`tasks/01_wait_for_api.yml`](tasks/01_wait_for_api.yml) (\"Vent til Stalwart forlader bootstrap-tilstand\") og [`tasks/11_oidc_restart.yml`](tasks/11_oidc_restart.yml) pass `-u STALWART_ADMIN_USER:STALWART_ADMIN_PASSWORD` til `curl` Indenfor `container exec`, så inddrivelse admin adgangskode sidder i den afleverede shell kommando (trykt som `cmd` på `-vv` mens `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS` er slukket) og i beholderens procesliste [`tasks/jmap_call.yml`](tasks/jmap_call.yml) allerede fodrer det samme par gennem `curl -K -` på stdin. Valgmulighed: Rute begge venter igennem `jmap_call.yml` eller det samme stdin config mønster."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Credentials travel in argv: `tasks/stack_host/02_credentials.yml` lines 23, 44, 61 and 65 pass `DISCOURSE_ADMIN_PASSWORD` and `DISCOURSE_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET` as `container exec -e NAME=<value>` argv elements, which the deploy log prints at `-vv`, and `ansible.builtin.command` runs `expandvars` over them, so a value containing `$` changes silently. Options: `-e NAME` without a value plus the task's `environment:`, or `expand_argument_vars: false` together with the stdin route."
msgstr "Valgret rejser i argv: `tasks/stack_host/02_credentials.yml` linjer 23, 44, 61 og 65 pass `DISCOURSE_ADMIN_PASSWORD` og `DISCOURSE_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET` som `container exec -e NAME=<value>` argv elementer, som deployering log udskriver på `-vv`, og `ansible.builtin.command` runs `expandvars` over dem, så en værdi, der indeholder `$` ændringer i stilhed. Indstillinger: `-e NAME` uden en værdi plus opgavens `environment:`, eller `expand_argument_vars: false` sammen med stdin ruten."

