msgid "Docker hands every container that joins the bridge without an ``ipv4_address`` the lowest free address of the pool. Worktree stacks join the primary's network as the cache network, so without a pool they took the primary's static addresses below .128. The pool is the upper half of the final ``INFINITO_SUBNET``; every static address sits in the lower half."
msgstr "Docker hænder hver beholder, der slutter broen uden en ``ipv4_address`` poolens laveste frie adresse. Worktree stakke deltage i den primære netværk som cache netværk, så uden en pool de tog den primære statiske adresser nedenfor.128. Poolen er den øverste halvdel af finalen. ``INFINITO_SUBNET``; hver statisk adresse sidder i den nederste halvdel."

