# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every desk list page logs one `Executing inline event handler violates the following Content Security Policy directive 'script-src-attr 'self''` per page menu entry (measured: 17 `a.grey-link[onclick]` on `/desk/build/todo`, 16 on `/desk/users/user`, 49 console errors after two list pages). Cause: Frappe renders the page menu entries with `onClick=\"return false;\"` (`frappe/public/js/frappe/ui/page.js:564,577` at v16.50.0) and `meta/csp.yml` allows no inline handler, so a click on such an entry also follows its `href=\"#\"`. Options: allow that one handler through `'unsafe-hashes'` plus its hash in `script-src-attr`, or accept the blocked handler since the menu actions run through jQuery handlers."
msgstr "Hver skrivebordsliste side logger en `Executing inline event handler violates the following Content Security Policy directive 'script-src-attr 'self''` per side menuindgang (målt: 17 `a.grey-link[onclick]` om `/desk/build/todo`, 16 om `/desk/users/user`, 49 konsol fejl efter to listesider). Årsag: Frappe gør sidemenuindgange med `onClick=\"return false;\"` (`frappe/public/js/frappe/ui/page.js:564,577` ved v16.50.0) og `meta/csp.yml` tillader ingen inline håndtering, så et klik på en sådan post følger også dens `href=\"#\"`. Valgmuligheder: tillade, at en kontakt gennem `'unsafe-hashes'` plus dens hash i `script-src-attr`, eller acceptere den blokerede kontaktperson, da menuhandlingerne kører gennem jQuery-håndterende."

