# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs cannot publish mirror packages directly, so their runs wait for the `pull_request_target` mirror producer before continuing. The producer mirrors with the Docker Hub credentials only for trusted PRs ([🛡️ Trusted](#trusted-fork-prs-)); untrusted forks mirror anonymously (no organization secrets). See [mirror.md](../image/mirror.md) for the mirroring architecture and naming convention."
msgstr "Fork PRs kan ikke udgive spejlpakker direkte, så deres kørsler venter på `pull_request_target` Spejlproducent før fortsættelse. Producenten spejle med Docker Hub legitimation kun for betroede PRs ([🛡️ Trusted](#trusted-fork-prs-)); Ubetroede gafler spejl anonymt (ingen organisationshemmeligheder)Se. [mirror.md](../image/mirror.md) for den spejlende arkitektur og navngivning konvention."

