# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for cross-role variable and defaults hygiene: `TOP_LEVEL_CONSTANT` uniqueness across `roles/*/vars/**`, `roles/*/defaults/**`, and `group_vars/**`; and the prohibition against overriding Ansible facts via `vars:` or `set_fact:`."
msgstr "Integrationstest for tværrollevariabel og standardhygiejne: `TOP_LEVEL_CONSTANT` enestående på tværs `roles/*/vars/**`, `roles/*/defaults/**`, og `group_vars/**`; og forbud mod altoverskyggende forhold `vars:` eller `set_fact:`."

# filterplugins under `plugins/filter/` og `roles/*/filter_plugins/`: Hvert
