# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Jenkins loads `https://usage.jenkins.io/usage-stats.js` from the page footer once per day (measured on the first signed-in page view: console `Loading the script 'https://usage.jenkins.io/usage-stats.js?...' violates the following Content Security Policy directive`); usage statistics are on by default and `templates/casc.yaml.j2` does not switch them off, so every instance tries to phone home and the platform CSP blocks it. Options: set `noUsageStatistics: true` under `jenkins:` in `templates/casc.yaml.j2` (confirm the key on `/manage/configuration-as-code/reference`) and assert in the spec that no request leaves for `usage.jenkins.io`."
msgstr "Jenkins belastninger `https://usage.jenkins.io/usage-stats.js` fra sidefod én gang om dagen (målt på den første signed-i sidevisning: konsol `Loading the script 'https://usage.jenkins.io/usage-stats.js?...' violates the following Content Security Policy directive`); brugsstatistik er som standard og `templates/casc.yaml.j2` ikke slukke dem, så hver instans forsøger at ringe hjem og platformen CSP blokerer det. Indstillinger: sæt `noUsageStatistics: true` under `jenkins:` til `templates/casc.yaml.j2` (bekræfte nøglen på `/manage/configuration-as-code/reference`) og hævder i spec, at ingen anmodning forlader `usage.jenkins.io`."

