msgid "No Playwright scenario gates on ``ldap``, and `services.yml <./meta/services.yml>`__ exempts the flag from the Playwright service-flag check. The indexer configures LDAP only as ``ldap_authz_domain``, which adds ``backend_roles`` to a user Keycloak or ``internal_users.yml`` already authenticated, so the stack has no LDAP-bind login to drive: with ``sso`` on every directory account signs in through Keycloak, which `files/playwright/test-rbac-roles.js <./files/playwright/test-rbac-roles.js>`__ covers, and with ``sso`` off only the internal ``admin`` and ``kibanaserver`` accounts can sign in."
