msgid "Shared request limit: `templates/config.yml.j2` includes `templates/web.ratelimited.template.yml`, whose nginx `limit_req` keys on `$binary_remote_addr`, and behind the front proxy every client arrives from the proxy's address. A gallery run of one administrator (about 25 page loads per minute) drew 586 responses with status 429 within four minutes, so one busy client throttles the whole forum. Options: set `real_ip_header X-Forwarded-For` with `set_real_ip_from` for the proxy network in a launcher `run:` step, or raise `reqs_per_second`/`reqs_per_minute` in `params`. Both change the bootstrap digest and rebuild the image."
msgstr "Fælles ansøgningsgrænse: `templates/config.yml.j2` omfatter `templates/web.ratelimited.template.yml`, hvis nginx `limit_req` taster på `$binary_remote_addr`, og bag den forreste proxy hver klient ankommer fra proxyens adresse. Et galleri af én administrator (om 25 Sidebelastninger pr. minut) tegnet 586 svar med status 429 Inden for fire minutter, så en travl klient styrter hele forummet. Indstillinger: sæt `real_ip_header X-Forwarded-For` med `set_real_ip_from` for proxynetværket i en afsender `run:` trin eller raise `reqs_per_second`/`reqs_per_minute` til `params`. Begge ændre bootstrap fordøje og genopbygge billedet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Shared sign-in budget: `POST /api/auth/token` allows 5 attempts per 15 minutes per `request.remote`, and the app ignores `X-Forwarded-For`, so every browser behind the front proxy and the deploy's own token request share one bucket (measured: all logins in `/api/admin/auth-audit` come from `192.168.75.1`). At 2026.10.11 the budget is the module constant `AUTH_TOKEN_RATE_LIMIT` in `socialhome/routes/users.py` with no env or TOML key, and `trusted_proxies` exists for the GFS only (`socialhome/global_server/config.py`); the design spec keeps one administrator token in the Playwright staging volume. Options: let the proxy reach the app with the client address (PROXY protocol or upstream trusted-proxy support), or ask upstream to honour a trusted forwarded header."
msgstr "Delte tegn på budget: `POST /api/auth/token` tillader 5 forsøg per 15 minutter pr. `request.remote`, og appen ignorerer `X-Forwarded-For`, så hver browser bag den forreste proxy og deployeringen egen token anmodning deler en spand (målt: alle login in `/api/admin/auth-audit` kommer fra `192.168.75.1`). 2026.10.11 budgettet er modulet konstant `AUTH_TOKEN_RATE_LIMIT` til `socialhome/routes/users.py` uden env eller TOML-nøgle, og `trusted_proxies` findes kun for GFS (`socialhome/global_server/config.py`); design spec holder en administrator token i Playwright iscenesættelse volumen. Indstillinger: Lad proxy nå app 'en med klientadressen (Støtte til PROXY-protokol eller opstrøms trusted- proxy), eller bede opstrøms at ære en betroet videresendt header."

