msgid "Swarm loop routine: build a DinD cluster with swarm-zombie, reproduce the failure on the live cluster, fix in the repository, re-run the fixed role on the kept cluster with swarm-role-sync until it is green, then rebuild fresh as the gate. One model step reaches confidence on the live cluster; a wedged NFS mount stops the loop for make swarm-clean."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode"
msgstr "Varm tilstand"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - `<stack>_<service_key>`, matching how Docker Swarm names every service and how `container service ps` accepts them. The stack name is derived from ``application_id`` via the ``entity_name`` filter, mirroring how ``docker stack deploy`` composes the stack name in ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."
msgstr "Varm tilstand - `<stack>_<service_key>`, matchende hvordan Docker Swarm navngiver alle tjenester og hvordan `container service ps` accepterer dem. Stavens navn er afledt af ``application_id`` via ``entity_name`` filter, spejling hvordan ``docker stack deploy`` komponerer stakkens navn i ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - a shell subshell that resolves the running task's container ID at exec time, e.g. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Swarm names every service ``<stack>_<key>`` and accepts no prefix matching; the helper composes that name from STACK and SERVICE_KEY args. The subshell defers resolution to the moment of exec, avoiding the stale ID and parse-time-failure pitfalls of returning a resolved value at vars-resolution time."
msgstr "Swarm mode - en shell subshell, der løser den kørende opgaves container ID på exec tid, fx `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Sværm navne hver service ``<stack>_<key>`` og accepterer ingen præfiks matchning; hjælperen komponerer dette navn fra STACK og SERVICE_KEY Args. Den subshell udsætter opløsning til tidspunktet for exec, undgå den gamle ID og parse- time-svigt faldgruber at returnere en løst værdi på vars- opløsning tid."

# cluster registreringsdatabase vært: port (F.eks.
