msgstr "Test det ende til ende"

msgid "Testing routine: write or change a test through the shared file cache, run its one matching validation command serially, rerun it until it passes, and recover a failing stack before the commit hook runs make test."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "Prøvning"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests & Documentation"
msgstr "Test & Documentation"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests MUST live under `tests/unit/`."
msgstr "Prøverne skal leve under `tests/unit/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests MUST simulate real user behaviour by interacting with the rendered UI. Navigating directly to an action endpoint via `page.goto(<endpoint>)` is FORBIDDEN whenever a click target exists on the current surface. The most common offender is logout: a test MUST click a logout button or a logout link rendered by the role, never `page.goto(LOGOUT_URL)`. The same rule applies to login, password change, account deletion, file upload, post submission, and every other user-initiated action."
msgstr "Test SKAL simulere reel brugeradfærd ved at interagere med den afleverede UI. Navigering direkte til et handlingsendepunkt via `page.goto(<endpoint>)` er FORBIDEN når et klik mål eksisterer på den aktuelle overflade. Den mest almindelige gerningsmand er logout: en test SKAL klikke på en logout-knap eller et logout-link, der leveres af rollen, aldrig `page.goto(LOGOUT_URL)`. Den samme regel gælder for login, password ændring, konto sletning, fil upload, post indsendelse, og alle andre bruger- initieret handling."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests and documentation"
msgstr "Tests og dokumentation"

msgid "Tests and lints"
msgstr ""

msgid "Tests for managed fields"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST NOT cover unrelated OAuth2 or OIDC configuration. Generic OAuth2 / OIDC invariants belong one level up under `oauth2_oidc/`. Port and domain checks belong under `tests/integration/ports/` and `tests/integration/domains/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL IKKE dække ikke-relaterede OAuth2 eller OIDC-konfiguration. Generisk OAuth2 / OIDC invariants tilhører et niveau op under `oauth2_oidc/`. Port og domæne kontrol hører under `tests/integration/ports/` og `tests/integration/domains/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Ansible module / task usage rules."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun omfatte regler for brug af Ansible moduler / opgaver."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover CLI-level behavior (argument parsing, `--help`, dispatcher). Tests for the libraries that CLIs import MUST live under `tests/unit/` or the relevant topical cluster."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække CLI- niveau adfærd (argument om fortolkning `--help`, afsender). Test for de biblioteker, som CLI importerer SKAL leve under `tests/unit/` eller den relevante aktuelle klynge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Docker-specific semantics (images, tags, compose-service configuration). Generic compose-structure rules MUST live under `tests/integration/compose/`, and backup-related checks MUST live under `tests/integration/backups/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække Docker- specifikke semantik (billeder, tags, kompositservicekonfiguration). Generiske kompositstrukturregler SKAL leve under `tests/integration/compose/`, og backup- relateret kontrol SKAL leve under `tests/integration/backups/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover GitHub-side CI/CD artefacts (workflows, Dependabot, PR helpers). Tests for local `make` targets, role logic, or non-CI scripts MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække GitHub- side CI / CD artefakter (workflows, Independabot, PR-hjælpere). Test for lokale `make` mål, rolle logik, eller ikke-CI scripts SKAL leve andre steder under `tests/integration/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Jinja-level concerns (template parsing, `{% include %}` resolution, variable reference/definition symmetry). Filter-plugin tests MUST live under `tests/integration/filters/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække Jinja- niveau problemer (skabelonfortolkning `{% include %}` opløsning, variabel reference / definitionssymmetri). Filter- plugin test SKAL leve under `tests/integration/filters/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Jinja2 expression composition rules. Rules that validate where dotted-path targets are declared live in the sibling [`../variables/`](../variables/) directory."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække Jinja2 udtryksregler for sammensætning. Regler, der validerer hvor doted- path mål er erklæret levende i søskende [`../variables/`](../variables/) mappe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Playwright env-template / spec parity. The dashboard-scope sub-rule MUST live under [`dashboard/`](../dashboard/)."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække Playwright env- skabelon / spec paritet. Dashboard- scope underregel SKAL leve under [`dashboard/`](../dashboard/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Python source patterns. Dependency declarations MUST live under [`dependencies/`](../../repository/dependencies/); YAML/Jinja patterns MUST live under [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække Python kildemønstre. Afhængighedsanmeldelser skal være i overensstemmelse [`dependencies/`](../../repository/dependencies/); YAML / Jinja mønstre SKAL leve under [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover SQL-shape rules inside Ansible tasks."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække SQL- formregler inden for Ansible opgaver."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover SSO configuration invariants. Generic port-uniqueness and port-reference-validity rules MUST live under `tests/integration/ports/`, and domain-related checks MUST live under `tests/integration/domains/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække SSO-konfigurationsinvarianter. Generisk port- unikke og port- reference- gyldighed regler SKAL leve under `tests/integration/ports/`, og domæne-relateret kontrol SKAL leve under `tests/integration/domains/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `.sh` source patterns. Python rules MUST live under [`python/`](../python/); YAML/Jinja rules MUST live under [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække `.sh` kildemønstre. Python regler SKAL leve under [`python/`](../python/); YAML / Jinja regler SKAL leve under [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `.yml` / `.yaml` / `.j2` content patterns. Python source rules MUST live under [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/)."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække `.yml` / `.yaml` / `.j2` indhold mønstre. Python kilderegler SKAL leve under [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `08_networks.yml` consistency and its coupling to roles. Tests for port allocations MUST live under `tests/integration/ports/`, and domain-related checks MUST live under `tests/integration/domains/`."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække `08_networks.yml` konsistens og dens kobling til roller. Prøvning for tildeling af havne SKAL ske i henhold til `tests/integration/ports/`, og domæne-relateret kontrol SKAL leve under `tests/integration/domains/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `application_id` rules (presence, deprecation, prefix-to-role-name consistency). Generic application-role checks (web-app README, `applications[...]` / `group_names` usage) MUST live one level up under [`../`](../)."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække `application_id` regler (tilstedeværelse, deprecation, prefix- to- role- name konsistens). Generisk ansøgnings- rollekontrol (web- app README `applications[...]` / `group_names` anvendelse) SKAL leve et niveau op under [`../`](../)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `group_vars/` content. Tests for role-local vars, ports, networks, or domain registration MUST live under their topical cluster elsewhere in `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække `group_vars/` indhold. Test for role- lokale varevogne, havne, netværk eller domæneregistrering SKAL leve under deres aktuelle klynge andre steder i `tests/integration/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/main.yml` presence and field shape. Tests about role dependencies declared in that file (`dependencies:`) MUST live under [`dependencies/`](dependencies/); checks tied to `meta/services.yml` MUST live under [`services/`](services/) (with the ordering-only `galaxy_info.run_after` checks under [`services/run_after/`](services/run_after/)); checks against `meta/variants.yml` MUST live under [`variants/`](variants/)."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække `meta/main.yml` tilstedeværelse og feltform. Test af rolleafhængigheder angivet i denne fil (`dependencies:`) SKAL leve under [`dependencies/`](dependencies/); kontrol `meta/services.yml` SKAL leve under [`services/`](services/) (kun med ordren `galaxy_info.run_after` kontrol i henhold til [`services/run_after/`](services/run_after/)); kontrol mod `meta/variants.yml` SKAL leve under [`variants/`](variants/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/main.yml`'s `dependencies:` key. Checks tied specifically to `galaxy_info.run_after` (self-references, reference existence, run-after cycles) MUST live under [`../services/run_after/`](../services/run_after/). Generic structural role checks (folder names, presence of `meta/main.yml`, include target existence) MUST live two levels up under `tests/integration/roles/`."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække `meta/main.yml`s `dependencies:` Nøgle. Kontrol, der specifikt er knyttet til `galaxy_info.run_after` (selv- referencer, referenceeksistens, run- efter cyklusser) SKAL leve under [`../services/run_after/`](../services/run_after/). Generisk strukturel rollekontrol (mappenavne, tilstedeværelse af `meta/main.yml`, herunder måleksistensen) SKAL leve to niveauer op `tests/integration/roles/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/services.yml` shape and content. The ordering-only `galaxy_info.run_after` cluster lives in the [`run_after/`](run_after/) sub-cluster; coverage of `meta/variants.yml` lives one level up in [`../variants/`](../variants/); coverage of `meta/main.yml`'s `dependencies:` key lives in [`../dependencies/`](../dependencies/)."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække `meta/services.yml` form og indhold. Kun ordren `galaxy_info.run_after` klynge lever i [`run_after/`](run_after/) unit description in lists `meta/variants.yml` lever et niveau op i [`../variants/`](../variants/); dækning af `meta/main.yml`s `dependencies:` vigtige liv i [`../dependencies/`](../dependencies/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/variants.yml` shape and coverage. Coverage of `meta/services.yml` itself lives in [`../services/`](../services/); coverage of `meta/main.yml`'s `dependencies:` key lives in [`../dependencies/`](../dependencies/)."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække `meta/variants.yml` form og dækning. Dækning af `meta/services.yml` selv lever i [`../services/`](../services/); dækning af `meta/main.yml`s `dependencies:` vigtige liv i [`../dependencies/`](../dependencies/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `run_after` semantics. Checks that target the `dependencies:` key MUST live in the sibling [`../../dependencies/`](../../dependencies/) cluster; broader `meta/services.yml` shape checks MUST live one level up in [`../`](../)."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække `run_after` Semantik. Kontrol, der er rettet mod `dependencies:` tasten SKAL leve i søskende [`../../dependencies/`](../../dependencies/) klynge; bredere `meta/services.yml` Formkontroller SKAL leve et niveau op i [`../`](../)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `run_once_*` flags and their lifecycle. Tests for generic fact overrides, task includes, or block structure MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække `run_once_*` flag og deres livscyklus. Test for generisk kendsgerning tilsidesætter, opgaver omfatter, eller blok struktur SKAL leve andetsteds under `tests/integration/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover action plugins shipped under `plugins/action/` and their retry/error semantics. Tests that validate filter plugins, lookup plugins, or unrelated role logic MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække handlingsplugins, der sendes under `plugins/action/` og deres gentry / fejl semantik. Test, der validerer filterplugins, lookup plugins, eller ikke-relaterede rolle logik SKAL leve andre steder under `tests/integration/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover application-level role rules. Identity checks tied to the `application_id` variable itself (presence, uniqueness, deprecation, folder-name prefix, ports/domain/run_after/dependency consistency) MUST live under [`id/`](id/). Generic structural role checks MUST live one level up under [`../`](../)."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun omfatte regler for rolle på ansøgningsniveau. Identitetskontrol `application_id` variabel selv (tilstedeværelse, enestående, determination, folder- name prefix ports/domain/run_after/dependency overensstemmelse) SKAL leve under [`id/`](id/). Generiske strukturelle rollekontrol SKAL leve et niveau op til [`../`](../)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover backup-related configuration consistency. Tests that validate unrelated compose structure, port mappings, or runtime behavior MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække backup- relateret konfigurationskonsistens. Test, der validerer ikke-sammenhængende komposition struktur, port tilknytninger, eller runtime adfærd SKAL leve andre steder under `tests/integration/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover dependency declarations and requirement cross-references. Other Python source patterns MUST live under [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/)."
msgstr "Afprøvning i denne fortegnelse må kun omfatte afhængighedserklæringer og krav til krydshenvisninger. Andre Python kildemønstre SKAL leve under [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover documentation artefacts (`*.md`, README presence) and inline TODO markers. Code-level rules MUST live under [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/), [`shell/`](../../filesystem/shell/), or [`yaml/`](../yaml/)."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun omfatte dokumentation artefakter (`*.md`, README tilstedeværelse) og inline TODO markører. Regler for kodeniveau SKAL leve under [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/), [`shell/`](../../filesystem/shell/), eller [`yaml/`](../yaml/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover domain declarations (structure, uniqueness, reference validity). Tests related to port registration, OIDC redirect URIs, or CSP handling MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun omfatte domæneerklæringer (struktur, enestående, referencegyldighed). Test i forbindelse med havneregistrering, OIDC omdirigere URI 'er, eller CSP håndtering SKAL leve andre steder under `tests/integration/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover file-naming and test-discovery contracts. Other Python conventions MUST live under [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/)."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun omfatte kontrakter om filnavngivning og testopdagelse. Andre Python konventioner SKAL leve under [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover filter-plugin definition and usage. Action-plugin, lookup-plugin, and template-rendering tests MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække filter- plugin definition og brug. Action- plugin, look- plugin, og template- rendering tests SKAL leve andre steder under `tests/integration/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover handler invocation and naming rules. Tests for task-file includes, run-once flags, or block structure MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække regler for invocering af kontaktpersoner og navngivning. Test for proces- fil omfatter, run- once flag, eller blok struktur SKAL leve andetsteds under `tests/integration/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover inventory construction and schema-apply logic. Tests for provider resolution at the lookup layer MUST live under [`lookups/`](../lookups/); tests for the CLI wrappers that drive InventoryManager MUST live under [`cli/`](../../meta/cli/)."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække lageropbygning og skema-anvende logik. Test for udbyderens opløsning på lookuplaget SKAL leve under [`lookups/`](../lookups/); tests for CLI wrappers, der driver InventoryManager SKAL leve under [`cli/`](../../meta/cli/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover lookup-plugin behavior (schema validation of `lookup('config', …)` paths, caching semantics, performance smoke). Pure unit tests for a single lookup plugin's return values MUST live under `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække lookup- plugin adfærd (Skemavalidering af `lookup('config', …)` stier, caching semantik, performance røg). Ren enhedstest for en enkelt opslag plugin 's returværdier SKAL leve under `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover network/DNS/domain literal patterns. Compose- and role-level network structure MUST live under `tests/integration/infrastructure/networks/`."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække network/DNS/domain bogstavelige mønstre. Komponent- og role- niveau netværksstruktur SKAL leve under `tests/integration/infrastructure/networks/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover password/secret quoting and definition rules. Tests for filter plugins, Jinja syntax, or compose structure MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække kodeord / hemmelige citater og definitionsregler. Test for filter plugins, Jinja syntaks, eller komponere struktur SKAL leve andre steder under `tests/integration/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover prometheus-specific wiring and the prometheus service entry. Broader `meta/services.yml` shape rules MUST live one level up in [`services/`](../); the ordering-only `galaxy_info.run_after` cluster lives in [`run_after/`](../run_after/)."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun omfatte prometheus- specifikke ledninger og prometheusservice. Mindre `meta/services.yml` Form regler SKAL leve et niveau op i [`services/`](../); ordren-only `galaxy_info.run_after` klynge lever i [`run_after/`](../run_after/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover repository settings files (Claude Code config, IDE rule files, agent permission catalogues). Code conventions MUST live elsewhere under `tests/lint/repository/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække arkivindstillingsfiler (Claude Code config, IDE regel filer, agent tilladelse kataloger). Kode konventioner SKAL leve andre steder i `tests/lint/repository/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover repository/ref shape rules. Broader `meta/services.yml` invariants live one level up in [`services/`](../)."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække opbevarings- / ref- formregler. Mindre `meta/services.yml` invariants lever et niveau op i [`services/`](../)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover role-folder and role-name conventions. Per-role structural rules (`meta/`, `tasks/`, `templates/`) MUST live under the sibling clusters [`meta/`](../meta/), [`when/`](../when/), or [`run_once/`](../run_once/)."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække role- mappe og role- navn konventioner. Perrollestrukturregler (`meta/`, `tasks/`, `templates/`) SKAL leve under søskende klynger [`meta/`](../meta/), [`when/`](../when/), eller [`run_once/`](../run_once/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover role-level structural rules (folder naming, role-name regex). `meta/main.yml` presence and field checks MUST live under [`meta/`](meta/). Dependency-graph checks (self-, circular, unnecessary dependencies, `run_after`) MUST live under [`meta/dependencies/`](meta/dependencies/) (and the sibling [`meta/services/run_after/`](meta/services/run_after/)). Application-specific role rules (web-app README, `applications[...]` / `group_names` usage, `application_id` identity) MUST live under [`applications/`](applications/). `run_once_<role>` flag lifecycle checks MUST live under [`run_once/`](run_once/). Block-level `when:` hygiene (guard blocks, duplication, size) MUST live under [`when/`](when/). `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` target existence MUST live under [`includes/`](includes/). Compose- or handler-specific checks MUST live in their respective topical clusters."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun omfatte strukturelle regler for roleniveau (mappenavne, role- name regex). `meta/main.yml` Tilstedeværelse og markkontrol SKAL leve under [`meta/`](meta/). Afhængighed-grafkontrol (selv-, cirkulære, unødvendige afhængigheder `run_after`) SKAL leve under [`meta/dependencies/`](meta/dependencies/) (og søskende [`meta/services/run_after/`](meta/services/run_after/))Anvendelse-specifikke rolleregler (web- app README `applications[...]` / `group_names` anvendelse `application_id` identitet) SKAL leve under [`applications/`](applications/). `run_once_<role>` Flagets livscykluskontrol SKAL leve under [`run_once/`](run_once/). Block- level `when:` hygiejne (beskyttelsesklodser, dobbelt penetration, størrelse) SKAL leve under [`when/`](when/). `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` Målets eksistens SKAL leve under [`includes/`](includes/). Komponent- eller handler- specifikke kontroller SKAL leve i deres respektive aktuelle klynger."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover rules about block-level `when:` semantics and guard-block shape. `run_once_<role>` flag lifecycle checks MUST live under [`../run_once/`](../run_once/); rules about `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` target existence MUST live under [`../includes/`](../includes/)."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække regler om block- niveau `when:` semantik og garde-blok form. `run_once_<role>` Flagets livscykluskontrol SKAL leve under [`../run_once/`](../run_once/); regler om `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` Målets eksistens SKAL leve under [`../includes/`](../includes/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover rules about how playbooks invoke role groups and how the invokable-paths filter maps to stages. Tests for role-internal `meta/main.yml` MUST live under [`roles/meta/`](../../roles/meta/); tests for include/import target existence MUST live under [`roles/includes/`](../../roles/includes/)."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække regler om, hvordan playbooks påberåber rollegrupper og hvordan de invokable-stier filtrere kort til trin. Prøvning for role- intern `meta/main.yml` SKAL leve under [`roles/meta/`](../../roles/meta/); tests for inklusion / import target eksistens SKAL leve under [`roles/includes/`](../../roles/includes/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover rules about variable DEFINITION hygiene (uniqueness, naming, override prohibitions). Rules about variable USAGE in Jinja templates MUST live under [`jinja/`](../jinja/)."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun omfatte regler om variabel saneringshygiejne (Uniquity, navngivning, override forbud). Regler om variabel USAGE i Jinja skabeloner SKAL leve under [`jinja/`](../jinja/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover service-graph consistency rules."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun omfatte regler for tjenestekraft- graf- konsistens."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover service-registry semantics. Tests for `application_id` identity MUST live under `tests/integration/roles/applications/id/`, and generic role-structure rules MUST live under `tests/integration/roles/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække service- registreringsdatabasen semantik. Prøvning for `application_id` identitet SKAL leve under `tests/integration/roles/applications/id/`, og generiske rolestrukturregler SKAL leve under `tests/integration/roles/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover shell-invocation correctness inside Ansible tasks."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække shell- invocation korrekthed inden for Ansible opgaver."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover size/count thresholds on tracked files and folders. Naming, content, and dependency rules MUST live under their respective sibling clusters."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække størrelse / antal tærskler på sporede filer og mapper. Navngivning, indhold og afhængighedsregler SKAL leve under deres respektive søskende klynger."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover structural rules of `compose.yml.j2` and related compose artefacts. Tests for image versions, backups, or service-registry semantics MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne fortegnelse må kun omfatte strukturelle regler for `compose.yml.j2` og beslægtede komposition artefakter. Test for billedversioner, sikkerhedskopier eller service-registreringsdatabasen semantik SKAL leve andre steder under `tests/integration/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover target-existence rules for `include_*` / `import_*` directives. Rules about the block-level `when:` wrapping those includes MUST live under [`../when/`](../when/); rules about `run_once_<role>` flag inclusion MUST live under [`../run_once/`](../run_once/)."
