msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække `server.*` under- træ af `meta/services.yml`. Andre top-niveau invariants lever i søskende [`services/`](../services/) klynge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the category hierarchy itself. Tests for `application_id` classification driven by `invokable_paths.py` MUST live under `tests/integration/roles/applications/id/`."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække selve kategorihierarkiet. Prøvning for `application_id` klassificering drevet af `invokable_paths.py` SKAL leve under `tests/integration/roles/applications/id/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the dashboard-scope contract. Playwright env-template / spec parity tests MUST live under [`playwright/`](../playwright/)."
