# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the four classifications of a single project-wide match stream: literal-app calls (`test_literal_paths.py`), variable-app calls with an existing literal path (`test_variable_paths.py`), `~`-concatenated path expressions (`test_wildcard_paths.py`), and the strict per-role pass for `lookup('config', application_id, …)` calls inside `roles/<role>/...` (`test_role_local_paths.py`). Pure unit coverage of the lookup plugin's return values MUST live under `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække de fire klassificeringer af en enkelt projekt- bred match stream: litterære-app opkald (`test_literal_paths.py`), variable- app opkald med en eksisterende bogstavelig sti (`test_variable_paths.py`), `~`-konkatenerede sti udtryk (`test_wildcard_paths.py`), og den strenge per-rollepas for `lookup('config', application_id, …)` opkald indenfor `roles/<role>/...` (`test_role_local_paths.py`). Ren enhedsdækning af lookup- pluginets returværdier SKAL leve under `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the pure-function behaviour of `utils.cert_utils` and `utils.tls_common`. Lookup-plugin integration that depends on these modules MUST live under `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."
msgstr "Prøvninger i denne mappe SKAL kun dække den purefunktion adfærd af `utils.cert_utils` og `utils.tls_common`. Lookup- plugin integration, der afhænger af disse moduler SKAL leve under `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."

