# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``gitlab_repositories`` volume is declared ``nfs: false``, so in swarm mode it stays a plain node-local volume instead of being rewritten to the shared NFS backend. Gitaly is pinned to a single replica and, through ``placement: manager`` on its own ``meta/services.yml`` entry, to the manager node. The pin is per service: ``gitlab_uploads``, ``gitlab_shared`` and ``gitlab_builds`` keep their NFS backing, and the remaining services stay schedulable anywhere."
msgstr "Den ``gitlab_repositories`` mængde angives ``nfs: false``, så i sværm tilstand det forbliver en almindelig node-lokale volumen i stedet for at blive omskrevet til den fælles NFS motor. Gitaly er fastgjort til en enkelt kopi og, gennem ``placement: manager`` alene ``meta/services.yml`` entry, til manager node. Pinden er pr. service: ``gitlab_uploads``, ``gitlab_shared`` og ``gitlab_builds`` holde deres NFS opbakning, og de resterende tjenester forblive schedulable overalt."

