msgid "The block sits behind a ``file_exists`` guard on ``extensions/AWS/vendor/autoload.php``, because ``LocalSettings.php`` is rendered before the extensions are installed and the S3 backend ``require``\\ s that autoloader. ``tasks/02_extensions.yml`` asserts ``Aws\\S3\\S3Client`` resolves inside the container afterwards, so an unfinished composer step cannot reach a green deploy."
