# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bridge has two halves. Inside Blender an add-on opens a local socket; outside it the ``mcp-for-blender`` server speaks the Model Context Protocol over stdio and relays to that socket. Both halves come from the same pinned upstream distribution, which also carries the ``install-addon`` subcommand this role uses to place the Blender side."
msgstr "Broen har to halvdele. Indenfor Blender en add-on åbner en lokal sokkel; uden det den ``mcp-for-blender`` server taler Model Context Protocol over stdio og relæer til denne sokkel. Begge halvdele stammer fra samme faste opstrøms distribution, som også bærer ``install-addon`` underkommando denne rolle bruger til at placere Blender side."

