# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker looks up the caller's agent for that platform by name. When none exists it creates one; when it is stopped it starts it; it then waits until the agent answers its health endpoint."
msgstr "Mægleren tjekker opkalderens agent for platformen ved navn. Når ingen findes, skaber den én; når den stoppes, starter den; den venter så, indtil agenten svarer på sit helbredstegn."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker reaches the container engine only through a filtered unix socket in a volume it shares with the socket proxy. The proxy serves no TCP port; in compose it also runs with `network_mode: none`, while a swarm task carries the stack's default overlay attachment. The proxy admits only the container, service, task, network, volume and image calls the broker makes, and refuses every other method and path, including exec and delete. The image, runtime, limits and mounts of an agent are fixed by the broker, never taken from the request."
msgstr "Mægleren når kun containeren motor gennem en filtreret unix sokkel i et volumen, den deler med sokkel proxy. Proxyen tjener ingen TCP port; i komponere det også kører med `network_mode: none`, mens en sværm opgave bærer stakkens standard overlay vedhæftet fil. Proxy indrømmer kun container, service, opgave, netværk, volumen og billede opkald mægleren gør, og nægter alle andre metoder og sti, herunder exec og slette. Billedet, runtime, grænser og monteringer af en agent er fastsat af mægleren, aldrig taget fra anmodningen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker rejects any request whose bearer is not the broker key, and any request without a user id header."
msgstr "Mægleren afviser enhver anmodning, hvis ihændehaver ikke er mæglernøglen, og enhver anmodning uden en bruger id header."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker resolves the caller's groups from Keycloak on every completion and refuses with HTTP 403 when the caller is not in the `agent-user` group of the requested platform."
msgstr "Mægleren løser den kaldende grupper fra Keycloak om hver afslutning og nægter med HTTP 403 når den, der ringer, ikke er i `agent-user` gruppe af den anmodede platform."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The broker sits behind `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar and in front of the official `@bluesky-social/social-app` web client. On a user's first OIDC-authenticated visit, the broker:"
msgstr "Mægleren sidder bag `web-app-keycloak`SSO- proxy sidevogn og foran den officielle `@bluesky-social/social-app` Webklient. På en brugers første OIDC- godkendt besøg, mægleren:"

msgid "The broker spawns agent runtimes and hands out short-lived credentials; the orchestrator runs the routines, receives the webhooks and drives the channels; the provisioner owns the instance API, the accounts and the lease reaper. The agents act on the forges, board, identity, channels and mail sink declared alongside them, and reach the models through the local gateway. `AGENT_FIXTURE_BUNDLE` is set here so `web-app-agent-fixture` deploys; the fixture carries seeded findings for the hacker, security and counsel scenarios and refuses to deploy from any other inventory."
