msgid "The footprint is the min_storage a row declares against the free space, with the watchdog floor on top, the comparison ``make swarm-zombie``'s pre-flight refuses on. A compose row declares what ``STORAGE_CONSTRAINED`` sums for it, a swarm row what its include set declares. The cost is measured when a deploy log or a role-runtimes CSV is handed in (each row costs the profiled seconds of the roles its include set deploys, unprofiled roles named), and the declared bytes otherwise. Either way the output names its source."
msgstr ""

