# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The list was held against the repository by three lints that parsed this section. They are gone, and the trade is deliberate: a lint that reads prose ties every role addition to an edit here, and the audit is a review record rather than a runtime registry. What they proved while they ran is worth keeping: the classification check named twenty-four roles whose audit entry contradicted their own metadata the first time it ran, nine of them shipping an adapter while the list still called them untried candidates. Without them, a role added later is absent here until someone notices."
msgstr "Listen blev holdt mod lageret af tre linter, der fortolkede dette afsnit. De er væk, og handlen er bevidst: en lint, der læser prosa er enhver rolle ud over en redigering her, og revisionen er en revision rekord snarere end en runtime register. Hvad de viste, mens de kørte er værd at holde: klassificering check hedder twenty- fire roller, hvis revision post modsiger deres egne metadata første gang det kørte, ni af dem forsendelse en adapter, mens listen stadig kaldte dem uprøvede kandidater. Uden dem, en rolle tilføjet senere er fraværende her indtil nogen bemærker."

