msgstr "Beskyttelsesreglerne `main` er dokumenteret i [branch.md](../../tools/github/branch/security.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The protocol is the reason this is a lookup rather than a two-term expression. ``tests/lint/repository/yaml/test_literal_protocol_with_lookup.py`` forbids gluing a literal ``http://`` in front of a value a lookup produced, because the protocol must come from wherever the TLS posture is decided. A container network has no TLS posture: it speaks plaintext by construction. Writing that out per call site meant repeating the same ``# nocheck: literal-protocol-lookup`` next to every one of them, which states a decision nine times instead of once. Holding it here states it once, and the call sites carry no literal protocol for the lint to see."
msgstr "Protokollen er grunden til, at dette er et opslag snarere end et udtryk med to ord. ``tests/lint/repository/yaml/test_literal_protocol_with_lookup.py`` Forbud mod at lime bogstavelig talt ``http://`` foran en værdi en opslag produceret, fordi protokollen skal komme fra hvor TLS holdning er besluttet. Et containernetværk har ingen TLS holdning: det taler klartekst ved konstruktion. At skrive det ud pr. opkaldssted betød at gentage det samme ``# nocheck: literal-protocol-lookup`` ved siden af hver enkelt af dem, som angiver en beslutning ni gange i stedet for én gang. At holde det her siger det en gang, og opkaldsstederne har ingen bogstavelig protokol at se."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The provider credential is whatever ``mcp.credential`` declares: ``owner`` names the principal, ``source`` where its secret lives (``token_store`` or the role's own ``credentials``), ``key`` the entry. No provider inherits the administrator's token."
msgstr "Udbyderen creditial er uanset ``mcp.credential`` erklærer: ``owner`` den hovedforpligtede ``source`` hvor dens hemmelighed lever (``token_store`` eller rollens egen ``credentials``), ``key`` indgang. Ingen udbyder arver administratorens symbol."

