msgid "The replay used to be a job of its own, picking one random role per run. It rides on a deploy row instead, marked with ``instructions`` (the mode the replay runs in). The job title says nothing about it: the row is an ordinary deploy of its variant, and the guide host is one more service that variant pulls in."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The replay's host rides on another role's deploy row and would otherwise take that row's round index, which for a passenger is an arbitrary shape. The README's Production block describes the bare role, so the host takes its smallest variant in every round instead."
msgstr "Replay 's vært rider på en anden rolles deployering række og ville ellers tage denne række runde indeks, som for en passager er en vilkårlig form. README' s produktionsblok beskriver den nøgne rolle, så værten tager sin mindste variant i hver runde i stedet."

