# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role brings up Penpot’s containerized stack behind the standard Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy and wires it into central identity, backup, and dashboard infrastructure. It follows the per-role meta layout (`layout.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md>`__) and is modeled on ```web-app-openproject`` <../web-app-openproject/>`__ and ```web-app-baserow`` <../web-app-baserow/>`__."
msgstr "Rollen bringer Penpot's containerized stak bag standarden Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy og wire det ind i central identitet, backup, og dashboard infrastruktur. Det følger perrolle meta layout (`layout.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md>`__) og er modelleret på ```web-app-openproject`` <../web-app-openproject/>`__ and ```web-app-baserow`` <../web-app-baserow/>`Det er en god idé."

msgid "The role builds a custom openvscode-server image that adds the Claude Code extension, runs it as a single container pinned to the Kata or gVisor runtime that ``svc-virt-kata`` selects for the host, keeps its editor state in a persistent volume, and fronts it with an OAuth2 proxy and Keycloak sign-in when Keycloak is part of the deployment. The broker (``svc-ai-agent-broker``) clones this workspace per agent and per user from the same image and isolation contract."
msgstr ""

msgid "The role builds a custom openvscode-server image that adds the Claude Code extension, runs it as a single container pinned to the Kata or gVisor runtime that `svc-virt-kata` selects for the host, keeps its editor state in a persistent volume, and fronts it with an OAuth2 proxy and Keycloak sign-in when Keycloak is part of the deployment. The broker (`svc-ai-agent-broker`) clones this workspace per agent and per user from the same image and isolation contract."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "The role builds a lean custom image on top of the official Jira Software image, provisions persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Variables control image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM heap sizing follows the container's `mem_limit`: `JVM_MAXIMUM_MEMORY` is 70 % of it and `JVM_MINIMUM_MEMORY` 35 %."
msgstr "Rollen bygger en magert brugerdefineret billede på toppen af den officielle Jira Software billede, bestemmelser vedvarende mængder, og udsætter app 'en bag din omvendte proxy. Styring af variabler image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM bunke størrelse følger containerens `mem_limit`: `JVM_MAXIMUM_MEMORY` er 70 % af det og `JVM_MINIMUM_MEMORY` 35 %."

