# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role directory name is the `application_id`. For example `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` is exposed as `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` as `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, and so on."
msgstr "Rollemappenavn er `application_id`. For eksempel `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` er eksponeret som `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` som `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, og så videre."

