# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The script opens the LUKS device (interactive passphrase prompt; `--passphrase-stdin` for automation), mounts it, picks the newest device snapshot across every machine hash (a fresh host after total loss has a new machine id), mirrors it into the target (`rsync -aHAX --delete`) and unmounts/closes the device again. No pre-recover service backup runs: the device itself is the backup this role maintains. Afterwards restore individual applications from the backup root with the matching role's `recover.py` (`svc-bkp-volume-2-local` for docker volumes, `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local` for NFS exports)."
msgstr "Scriptet åbner LUKS enheden (interaktiv passrase prompt `--passphrase-stdin` til automatisering), monterer det, vælger den nyeste enhed snapshot over hver maskine hash (en frisk vært efter totalt tab har en ny maskine id), spejler det ind i målet (`rsync -aHAX --delete`) og afmonterer / lukker enheden igen. Ingen pre- recovery service backup kører: selve enheden er sikkerhedskopi denne rolle fastholder. Derefter gendanne individuelle programmer fra backup root med matchende rolles `recover.py` (`svc-bkp-volume-2-local` for docker volumener `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local` for NFS-eksport)."

