# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The stats pages (`/<keyword>+`) draw no charts: they load the legacy, unversioned Google Charts loader `https://www.google.com/jsapi` (YOURLS 1.10.6 `includes/functions-html.php:121-125`), which the role CSP blocks in `script-src-elem`, so every inline `google.visualization` call throws. Measured on `/design01+`: one CSP console error for `jsapi` and five `google is not defined` page errors; the tabs and the click tables still render. The sources tab also requests referrer favicons from the hosts `www.google.com` (path `/s2/favicons`) and `t0.gstatic.com` (path `/faviconV2`). Options: allow `www.google.com` and `www.gstatic.com` in `meta/csp.yml` (pulls an unpinned third-party script into the admin), replace the charts through a YOURLS plugin, or accept empty chart boxes."
msgstr "Statistisk side (`/<keyword>+`) tegne ingen diagrammer: de indlæse arven, unversioned Google Charts loader `https://www.google.com/jsapi` (YOURLS 1.10.6 `includes/functions-html.php:121-125`), som rollen CSP blokerer i `script-src-elem`, så hver inline `google.visualization` Call kaster. Målt den `/design01+`: en CSP konsol fejl for `jsapi` og fem `google is not defined` side fejl; faner og klik tabeller stadig gøre. Fanebladet Kilder anmoder også om mere favorikoner fra værterne `www.google.com` (sti `/s2/favicons`) og `t0.gstatic.com` (sti `/faviconV2`). Tilvalg: tillad `www.google.com` og `www.gstatic.com` til `meta/csp.yml` (trækker en udelt tredjeparts script ind i admin), erstatte diagrammer gennem en YOURLS plugin, eller acceptere tomme diagramfelter."

