# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys [PhpMyAdmin](https://www.phpmyadmin.net/) in a secure Docker environment, complete with optional OAuth2 proxy support. It enables seamless management of MariaDB/MySQL databases via a web-app-based interface."
msgstr "Denne ansible rolle [PhpMyAdmin](https://www.phpmyadmin.net/) i et sikkert Docker miljø, komplet med valgfri OAuth2 proxy- understøttelse. Den muliggør en problemfri forvaltning af MariaDB/ MySQL databaser via en web- app- baseret grænseflade."

