# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role extracts the project version from the local ``pyproject.toml`` (using ``playbook_dir``) and writes it as a system-wide environment variable into ``/etc/environment`` on the managed host."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle udtrækker projektversionen fra den lokale ``pyproject.toml`` (anvendelse ``playbook_dir``) og skriver det som en system- bred miljø variabel i ``/etc/environment`` på den forvaltede vært."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role extracts the project version from the local `pyproject.toml` (using `playbook_dir`) and writes it as a system-wide environment variable into `/etc/environment` on the managed host."
