# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role facilitates the deployment of a MariaDB server using Docker. It is designed to ensure ease of installation and configuration, with the flexibility to adapt to different environments."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle letter udbredelsen af en MariaDB server ved hjælp af Docker. Det er designet til at sikre nem installation og konfiguration, med fleksibilitet til at tilpasse sig forskellige miljøer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role guarantees that a target resolves the `*.localhost` names it serves, without going through DNS."
msgstr "Denne rolle sikrer, at et mål løser `*.localhost` navne det tjener, uden at gå gennem DNS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role guarantees that a target resolves the ``*.localhost`` names it serves, without going through DNS."
msgstr "Denne rolle sikrer, at et mål løser ``*.localhost`` navne det tjener, uden at gå gennem DNS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects a custom JavaScript snippet into all HTML responses served by NGINX. It leverages NGINX’s ``sub_filter`` to seamlessly insert your application-specific script just before the closing ``</head>`` tag, ensuring that your code runs on every page load, which is useful for global feature flags, analytics, or UI enhancements."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle antyder en brugerdefineret JavaScript snippet i alle HTML-svar tjent med NGINX. Det bruger NGINX 's ``sub_filter`` til problemfrit indsætte din applikation- specifikke script lige før lukning ``</head>`` tag, sikre, at din kode kører på hver side belastning, hvilket er nyttigt for globale feature flag, analytics, eller UI forbedringer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects a custom JavaScript snippet into all HTML responses served by NGINX. It leverages NGINX’s `sub_filter` to seamlessly insert your application-specific script just before the closing `</head>` tag, ensuring that your code runs on every page load, which is useful for global feature flags, analytics, or UI enhancements."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle antyder en brugerdefineret JavaScript snippet i alle HTML-svar tjent med NGINX. Det bruger NGINX 's `sub_filter` til problemfrit indsætte din applikation- specifikke script lige før lukning `</head>` tag, sikre, at din kode kører på hver side belastning, hvilket er nyttigt for globale feature flag, analytics, eller UI forbedringer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects a small JavaScript snippet into your HTML responses that enables parent pages to get notified whenever the iframe’s location changes and forces external links to open in a new tab."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle antyder en lille JavaScript snippet i din HTML-svar, der gør det muligt for forældre sider at få besked, når iframe placering ændringer og tvinger eksterne links til at åbne i en ny fane."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects the corporate design into every NGINX-served application whose ``design`` service is enabled. It derives the design tokens from the single base color in ``web-svc-design`` through the `design_palette <../../plugins/lookup/design_palette.py>`__ lookup (OKLCH, WCAG 2.2 contrast by construction) and maps them onto Bootstrap and common app variables."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle indgyder virksomhedens design i hver NGINX- serveret ansøgning, hvis ``design`` service er aktiveret. Det stammer design tokens fra den enkelte base farve i ``web-svc-design`` gennem `design_palette <../../plugins/lookup/design_palette.py>`__ lookup (OKLCH, WCAG 2.2 kontrasten efter konstruktion) og kortlægger dem på Bootstrap og fælles app variabler."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects the corporate design into every NGINX-served application whose `design` service is enabled. It derives the design tokens from the single base color in `web-svc-design` through the [design_palette](../../plugins/lookup/design_palette.py) lookup (OKLCH, WCAG 2.2 contrast by construction) and maps them onto Bootstrap and common app variables."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle indgyder virksomhedens design i hver NGINX- serveret ansøgning, hvis `design` service er aktiveret. Det stammer design tokens fra den enkelte base farve i `web-svc-design` gennem [design_palette](../../plugins/lookup/design_palette.py) lookup (OKLCH, WCAG 2.2 kontrasten efter konstruktion) og kortlægger dem på Bootstrap og fælles app variabler."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs **fakeroot** for the current Linux distribution. Fakeroot enables non-privileged users to simulate root-level file manipulations, making it ideal for building packages or performing file operations that normally require root permissions."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer **fakeroot** for den aktuelle Linux-distribution. Fakeroot gør det muligt for ikke-privilegerede brugere at simulere root- niveau fil manipulationer, hvilket gør det ideelt til at bygge pakker eller udføre fil operationer, der normalt kræver root tilladelser."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs GNU Make on Arch Linux systems using the Pacman package manager. GNU Make is a build automation tool that automatically builds executable programs and libraries from source code by reading files called Makefiles."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer GNU Make på Arch Linux-systemer ved hjælp af Pacman pakkehåndtering. GNU Gør er en bygge automatisering værktøj, der automatisk bygger eksekverbare programmer og biblioteker fra kildekode ved at læse filer kaldet Makefiles."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs Git on the target system using the Pacman package manager. It ensures that Git is installed only once, even when the role is applied to multiple hosts or executed in a multi-task scenario."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer Git på målsystemet ved hjælp af Pacman pakkehåndtering. Det sikrer, at Git er installeret kun én gang, selv når rollen anvendes på flere værter eller udføres i en multi-opgave scenario."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs Node.js on the target system using the native package manager."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer Node.js på målsystemet ved hjælp af den indfødte pakkehåndtering."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs [Kevin's Package Manager](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager) and updates packages using `pkgmgr` on Arch Linux systems. It provides a unified interface for package installation and update management, ensuring consistent deployment across environments."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer [Kevin 's Package Manager](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager) og opdaterer pakker med brug `pkgmgr` på Arch Linux-systemer. Det giver en samlet grænseflade til pakkeinstallation og opdatering management, der sikrer konsekvent implementering på tværs af miljøer."

