# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures **msmtp** (plus optional sendmail compatibility) across the default Infinito distro set: Arch Linux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora and CentOS. It provides a lightweight SMTP client that serves as a drop-in replacement for traditional sendmail workflows, enabling reliable email delivery via an external SMTP server. For more background on SMTP, see [SMTP on Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMTP)."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer og installerer **msmtp** (plus valgfri sendmail kompatibilitet) på tværs af standard Infinito distro set: Arch Linux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora og CentOS. Det giver en letvægts SMTP-klient, der fungerer som en drop-i erstatning for traditionelle sendmail arbejdsgange, hvilket muliggør pålidelig e-mail levering via en ekstern SMTP-server. For mere baggrund på SMTP, se [SMTP på Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMTP)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures **msmtp** (plus optional sendmail compatibility) across the default Infinito distro set: Arch Linux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora and CentOS. It provides a lightweight SMTP client that serves as a drop-in replacement for traditional sendmail workflows, enabling reliable email delivery via an external SMTP server. For more background on SMTP, see `SMTP on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMTP>`__."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer og installerer **msmtp** (plus valgfri sendmail kompatibilitet) på tværs af standard Infinito distro set: Arch Linux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora og CentOS. Det giver en letvægts SMTP-klient, der fungerer som en drop-i erstatning for traditionelle sendmail arbejdsgange, hvilket muliggør pålidelig e-mail levering via en ekstern SMTP-server. For mere baggrund på SMTP, se `SMTP on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMTP>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures Firefox on Arch Linux systems, enforcing Enterprise Policies to automatically install key browser extensions. It ensures that Firefox is installed and set up with policies that force-install uBlock Origin and the KeePassXC Browser extension, delivering a secure and consistent browsing experience."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer og installerer Firefox på Arch Linux-systemer, håndhæve Enterprise Policies til automatisk at installere vigtige browserudvidelser. Det sikrer, at Firefox er installeret og oprettet med politikker, der kraft- installere uBlock Oprindelse og KeePassXC Browser udvidelse, levere en sikker og konsekvent browsing oplevelse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures [Kevin's Package Manager](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager) - a configurable Python tool designed to manage multiple repositories and automate common Git operations. The role clones the repository from GitHub, sets the executable permissions for the main script, and runs the installation command to set up command aliases."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer og installerer [Kevin 's Package Manager](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager) - et konfigurerbart Python værktøj designet til at styre flere datalagre og automatisere fælles Git operationer. Rollen kloner lageret fra GitHub, sætter de eksekverbare tilladelser til hovedscriptet, og kører installationskommandoen for at oprette kommandokalaser."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures `Kevin’s Package Manager <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager>`__ - a configurable Python tool designed to manage multiple repositories and automate common Git operations. The role clones the repository from GitHub, sets the executable permissions for the main script, and runs the installation command to set up command aliases."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer og installerer `Kevin’s Package Manager <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager>`__ - et konfigurerbart Python værktøj designet til at styre flere datalagre og automatisere fælles Git operationer. Rollen kloner lageret fra GitHub, sætter de eksekverbare tilladelser til hovedscriptet, og kører installationskommandoen for at oprette kommandokalaser."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures all the software required for Blu-ray playback on Arch Linux–based systems. It ensures that VLC and the necessary libraries for Blu-ray disc decryption and playback (``libaacs``, ``libbluray``) are present, and provides hooks for optional AUR packages."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer og konfigurerer al software, der kræves til Blu- ray afspilning på Arch Linux- baserede systemer. Det sikrer, at VLC og de nødvendige biblioteker til Blu- ray disk dekryptering og afspilning (``libaacs``, ``libbluray``) er til stede og giver kroge til valgfri AUR-pakker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures all the software required for Blu-ray playback on Arch Linux–based systems. It ensures that VLC and the necessary libraries for Blu-ray disc decryption and playback (`libaacs`, `libbluray`) are present, and provides hooks for optional AUR packages."
