# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures the Chromium browser along with essential security and productivity extensions. It ensures that Chromium is installed and properly set up with forced installation of uBlock Origin and the KeePassXC browser extension via Enterprise Policies, providing a secure and streamlined browsing experience."
msgstr "Denne rolle, der er ansvarlig for gennemførelsen af Chromium browser sammen med væsentlige sikkerheds- og produktivitetsudvidelser. Det sikrer, at Chromium er installeret og korrekt sat op med tvungen installation af uBlock Oprindelse og KeePassXC browser udvidelse via Enterprise Policies, giver en sikker og strømlinet browsing oplevelse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures the Nextcloud desktop client on Arch Linux systems. It also manages symbolic links from commonly used user directories (like `Documents`, `Pictures`, etc.) to the respective folders inside a cloud-synced Nextcloud directory. This ensures user data is seamlessly integrated into the synchronized cloud folder."
msgstr "Denne rolle, der er ansvarlig for gennemførelsen af Nextcloud desktopklient på Arch Linux-systemer. Det administrerer også symbolske links fra almindeligt anvendte brugermapper (som `Documents`, `Pictures`, osv.) til de respektive mapper inde i en cloud- synkroniseret Nextcloud mappe. Dette sikrer brugerdata er problemfrit integreret i den synkroniserede cloud mappe."

