# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures the Tor service and the Tor Browser Launcher, providing a privacy-focused web browsing environment on Pacman-based Linux distributions."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer og konfigurerer Tor service og Tor Browser Launcher, hvilket giver en privat-fokuseret web browsing miljø på Pacman- baserede Linux distributioner."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and executes [`dockreap`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/docker-volume-cleaner), a tool designed to clean up unused anonymous Docker volumes (including symlinks and their targets) to maintain a tidy Docker environment."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer og udfører [`dockreap`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/docker-volume-cleaner), et værktøj designet til at rydde op ubrugte anonyme Docker mængder (herunder symlinks og deres mål) at opretholde et ryddeligt Docker miljø."

