# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs everything needed for Arduino development on Arch Linux. It includes the official Arduino IDE, documentation, and user group configurations to enable serial port access for uploading code to boards."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer alt det nødvendige for Arduino udvikling på Arch Linux. Det omfatter den officielle Arduino IDE, dokumentation, og brugergruppe konfigurationer for at give seriel port adgang til upload kode til bestyrelser."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs non-free GPU drivers on Arch Linux systems by invoking the ``mhwd`` utility. It ensures that the appropriate proprietary drivers for your PCI graphics hardware are installed and ready for use."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle installerer non-free GPU drivere på Arch Linux-systemer ved at bruge ``mhwd`` nytte. Det sikrer, at de relevante proprietære drivere til din PCI grafik hardware er installeret og klar til brug."

