# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provisions a centralized database system in your Docker Compose environment. It supports both MariaDB and PostgreSQL, providing a robust, scalable, and low-maintenance database solution. Whether you're consolidating your application's data or creating a dedicated central storage, this role simplifies setup and integration."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle indeholder en central database system i din Docker Compose miljø. Det understøtter begge MariaDB og PostgreSQL, giver en robust, skalerbar, og lav-vedligeholdelse database løsning. Uanset om du konsoliderer din applikations data eller opretter en dedikeret central lagring, forenkler denne rolle opsætning og integration."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provisions a centralized database system in your Docker Compose environment. It supports both MariaDB and PostgreSQL, providing a robust, scalable, and low-maintenance database solution. Whether you’re consolidating your application’s data or creating a dedicated central storage, this role simplifies setup and integration."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle indeholder en central database system i din Docker Compose miljø. Det understøtter begge MariaDB og PostgreSQL, giver en robust, skalerbar, og lav-vedligeholdelse database løsning. Uanset om du konsoliderer din applikations data eller opretter en dedikeret central lagring, forenkler denne rolle opsætning og integration."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role removes NGINX configuration files and revokes and deletes Certbot certificates for domains marked as deprecated."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle fjerner NGINX konfigurationsfiler og tilbagekalder og sletter Certbot certifikater for domæner, der er mærket som forældede."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role runs Memcached as a central engine dependency, mirroring the central-database pattern (``svc-db-postgres``). A consumer reaches it either embedded (a sidecar inside its own stack, ``shared: false``) or from this central pinned stack (``shared: true``)."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle kører Memcached som en central motor afhængighed, afspejler centraldatabasemønsteret (``svc-db-postgres``). En forbruger når det enten indlejret (en sidevogn i sin egen stak ``shared: false``) eller fra denne centrale stak (``shared: true``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role runs Memcached as a central engine dependency, mirroring the central-database pattern (`svc-db-postgres`). A consumer reaches it either embedded (a sidecar inside its own stack, `shared: false`) or from this central pinned stack (`shared: true`)."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle kører Memcached som en central motor afhængighed, afspejler centraldatabasemønsteret (`svc-db-postgres`). En forbruger når det enten indlejret (en sidevogn i sin egen stak `shared: false`) eller fra denne centrale stak (`shared: true`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role sends periodic health check emails using **msmtp** to verify that your mail transport agent is operational. It deploys a simple script and hooks it into a systemd service and timer, with failure notifications sent via Telegram."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle sender periodiske sundhedstjek e-mails ved hjælp af **msmtp** at kontrollere, at din posttransportagent er operationel. Det anvender en simpel script og kroge det ind i en systemd service og timer, med svigt meddelelser sendt via Telegram."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role sets up a Python development environment on Arch Linux. It includes Python itself, the ``pip`` package manager, and builds on the general developer persona to support scripting, application development, data science, and more."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle opretter et Python udviklingsmiljø på Arch Linux. Det omfatter Python selv, ``pip`` pakkehåndtering, og bygger på den generelle udvikler persona til at støtte scripting, applikationsudvikling, datalogi, og meget mere."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role sets up a Python development environment on Arch Linux. It includes Python itself, the `pip` package manager, and builds on the general developer persona to support scripting, application development, data science, and more."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle opretter et Python udviklingsmiljø på Arch Linux. Det omfatter Python selv, `pip` pakkehåndtering, og bygger på den generelle udvikler persona til at støtte scripting, applikationsudvikling, datalogi, og meget mere."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role sets up and manages Akaunting, an innovative online accounting software, using Docker and Docker Compose. Empower your financial management with Akaunting, a dynamic and feature-rich accounting platform designed to simplify your bookkeeping and boost your business growth. Enjoy intuitive tools, real-time insights, and an energetic approach to your finances."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle opretter og forvalter Akaunting, en innovativ online bogholderi software, ved hjælp af Docker og Docker Compose. Styrke din økonomiske forvaltning med Akaunting, en dynamisk og feature- rige regnskabsplatform designet til at forenkle din bogføring og øge din virksomhed vækst. Nyd intuitive værktøjer, realtidsindsigt og en energisk tilgang til dine finanser."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Code of Conduct applies to all spaces managed by the Infinito.Nexus project, including GitHub repositories, mailing lists, chat rooms, and other communication channels."
msgstr "Dette Code Adfærdskodeksen gælder for alle rum, der forvaltes af Infinito.Nexus projekt, herunder GitHub-arkiver, postlister, chatrooms og andre kommunikationskanaler."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Docker Compose deployment automates the installation and operation of a Pixelfed instance."
msgstr "Dette Docker Compose deployering automatiserer installation og drift af en Pixelfed Et eksempel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Docker Compose deployment sets up PeerTube with integrated support for essential services such as a PostgreSQL database, Redis cache, and an NGINX reverse proxy for secure HTTPS termination and domain routing. The configuration supports advanced security settings, modular service scaling, and automated environment injection."
msgstr "Dette Docker Compose deployeringssystemer PeerTube med integreret støtte til væsentlige tjenester såsom PostgreSQL database Redis cache, og en NGINX reverse proxy til sikker HTTPS opsigelse og domæne routing. Konfigurationen understøtter avancerede sikkerhedsindstillinger, modulær service skalering, og automatiseret miljøindsprøjtning."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Docker Compose deployment uses Ansible automation to launch pgAdmin together with necessary network and volume configurations. It enables you to centrally manage your PostgreSQL databases with the following core software features:"
msgstr "Dette Docker Compose implementering bruger Ansible automatisering til at starte pgAdmin sammen med nødvendige netværk og volumen konfigurationer. Det giver dig mulighed for centralt at administrere din PostgreSQL databaser med følgende centrale softwarefunktioner:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Docker deployment uses Ansible automation to set up Snipe‑IT along with necessary services such as a MariaDB database, an optional OAuth2 proxy for additional security, and a reverse proxy configuration. The system is built for reliable asset management in various environments."
msgstr "Denne Docker implementering bruger Ansible automatisering til at oprette Snipe‑IT Det er derfor vigtigt at sikre, at der ikke sker forskelsbehandling på grundlag af nationalitet. MariaDB database, en valgfri OAuth2 proxy for yderligere sikkerhed, og en omvendt proxy konfiguration. Systemet er bygget til pålidelig formueforvaltning i forskellige miljøer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This README accompanies the Hunspell Playbook, located within the ``infinito`` repository. The playbook is focused on installing Hunspell, a widely-used spell checker, along with various language packages to enhance its functionality."
msgstr "README ledsager Hunspell Spillebog, der ligger inden for ``infinito`` lager. Spillebogen er fokuseret på at installere Hunspell, en widely- brugt stavekontrol, sammen med forskellige sprogpakker for at forbedre dens funktionalitet."

