msgid "This command displays a list of all users."
msgstr "Denne kommando viser en liste over alle brugere."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This command lets you access the bash shell inside the `application` Docker container where Pixelfed is running."
msgstr "Denne kommando giver dig adgang til bash skal inde i `application` Dokker container hvor Pixelfed Han løber."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This command will prompt you to enter the user's details like username, email, and password."
msgstr "Denne kommando vil bede dig om at indtaste brugerens oplysninger som brugernavn, e-mail og adgangskode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This containerized YOURLS solution is built on robust Docker Compose and Ansible automation. It simplifies the deployment process by integrating with centralized MariaDB management and providing pre‑configured health checks and environment settings. Whether you're looking to quickly generate memorable links or need detailed analytics, this deployment supports your digital strategy seamlessly."
msgstr "Denne container YOURLS Opløsning er bygget på robust Docker Compose og Ansibel automatisering. Det forenkler ibrugtagningsprocessen ved at integrere med centraliserede MariaDB forvaltning og levering af forud konfigureret sundhedskontrol og miljø indstillinger. Uanset om du søger at hurtigt generere mindeværdige links eller har brug for detaljerede analytics, denne implementering understøtter din digitale strategi problemfrit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This containerized YOURLS solution is built on robust Docker Compose and Ansible automation. It simplifies the deployment process by integrating with centralized MariaDB management and providing pre‑configured health checks and environment settings. Whether you’re looking to quickly generate memorable links or need detailed analytics, this deployment supports your digital strategy seamlessly."
msgstr "Denne container YOURLS Opløsning er bygget på robust Docker Compose og Ansibel automatisering. Det forenkler ibrugtagningsprocessen ved at integrere med centraliserede MariaDB forvaltning og levering af forud konfigureret sundhedskontrol og miljø indstillinger. Uanset om du søger at hurtigt generere mindeværdige links eller har brug for detaljerede analytics, denne implementering understøtter din digitale strategi problemfrit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This decision is **load-bearing**: openresty owns the `sys-front-inj-*` Lua body-rewriting pipeline (CSP-meta stripping, Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout snippet injection). Migrating to Traefik in v1 would silently drop that pipeline — it has no equivalent in Traefik without a non-trivial Yaegi-plugin port. Traefik migration is tracked as a Future Extension once edge-HA becomes worth the porting effort."
msgstr "Denne beslutning er **belastning-leje**: openresty ejer `sys-front-inj-*` Lua body- rewriting pipeline (CSP- meta-stripning Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout snippet injektion). Migrering til Traefik in v1 ville stille droppe denne rørledning - det har ingen tilsvarende i Traefik uden en ikke-triviel Yaegi- plugin port. Traefik migration spores som en fremtidig forlængelse, når edge- HA bliver værd porting indsats."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This declares two variants. Variant 0 pins every dynamic service-key from `meta/services.yml` to `enabled: true, shared: true` so the maximum-footprint baseline is explicit. Variant 1 keeps the same dynamic flags on and additionally flips Multisite on against three canonical domains."
msgstr "Dette erklærer to varianter. Variant 0 pins hver dynamisk service-key fra `meta/services.yml` til `enabled: true, shared: true` Så den maksimale-fodaftryk baseline er eksplicit. Variant 1 holder de samme dynamiske flag på og derudover flips Multisite på mod tre kanoniske domæner."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This deployment simplifies LDAP management by presenting a modern web interface that lets you search, modify, and manage directory entries easily. It supports integration with external LDAP servers and works seamlessly behind a reverse proxy, allowing administrators to focus on core directory tasks rather than deployment intricacies."
msgstr "Denne implementering forenkler LDAP-styring ved at præsentere en moderne webgrænseflade, der lader dig søge, ændre og administrere mappe- indgange nemt. Det understøtter integration med eksterne LDAP-servere og arbejder problemfrit bag en omvendt proxy, så administratorerne kan fokusere på centrale mappe- opgaver i stedet for implementeringsdetaljer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST NOT host application logic that belongs to an Ansible role."
msgstr "Denne mappe SKAL IKKE være vært for applikationslogik, der tilhører en Ansibel rolle."

# Scripts, der kører på udvikleren eller CI vært hører under deres workflow-
# specifikke sti (f.eks. `scripts/tests/`, `scripts/image/`, `scripts/meta/`).
# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST NOT host host-side tooling. Scripts that run on the developer or CI host belong under their workflow-specific path (for example `scripts/tests/`, `scripts/image/`, `scripts/meta/`)."
msgstr "Denne mappe må IKKE være vært for værts- side tooling. Scripts, der kører på udvikleren eller CI vært hører under deres workflow- specifikke sti (f.eks. `scripts/tests/`, `scripts/image/`, `scripts/meta/`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST contain only files consumed by the `coredns` compose service."
msgstr "Denne mappe SKAL kun indeholde filer der forbruges af `coredns` komponere service."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST contain only scripts that execute inside the `infinito` container, either as the container entrypoint, as a Docker `HEALTHCHECK`, or as a `systemd` unit hook."
msgstr "Denne mappe SKAL kun indeholde scripts som køres inde i `infinito` container, enten som container entrypoint, som en Docker `HEALTHCHECK`, eller som en `systemd` Unit hook."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains Ansible collection requirement files used by the installation logic."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder Ansible indsamling krav filer, der anvendes af installationen logik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains Jinja2 templates for different NGINX `location` blocks, each designed to proxy and optimize different types of web traffic. These templates are used by the `sys-svc-proxy` role to modularize and standardize reverse proxy configuration across a wide variety of applications."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder Jinja2 skabeloner for forskellige NGINX `location` blokke, hver designet til at proxy og optimere forskellige typer af web-trafik. Disse skabeloner anvendes af `sys-svc-proxy` rolle til at modulere og standardisere omvendt proxy konfiguration på tværs af en bred vifte af applikationer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains Pull Request-specific resolver scripts used by the PR workflow."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder Pull Request- specific resolver scripts brugt af PR-arbejdsgangen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains administrator-facing configuration references for Infinito.Nexus. Its scope is the global and per-application settings operators adjust through inventory, group vars, and application overrides."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder administrator- vender konfigurationsreferencer for Infinito.Nexus. Dens anvendelsesområde er den globale og per- applikation indstillinger operatører justere gennem opgørelse, gruppe vars, og ansøgning tilsidesætter."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains administrator-facing operational guides for Infinito.Nexus. Its scope is CLI installation, inventory creation, and deploy and redeploy flows for running environments."
msgstr "Denne fortegnelse indeholder administrative vejledninger til brug for Infinito.Nexus. Dens anvendelsesområde er CLI installation, lageropbygning, og implementere og omfordele strømme til kørende miljøer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains all deployable bundles for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder alle implementerbare bundter til Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains automation scripts used across the project."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder automatiseringsscripts, der anvendes på tværs af projektet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for GitHub Container Registry usage. Its scope is authentication, cleanup, and other GHCR-specific operational concerns in the repository."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder bidragsvejledning for brug af GitHub Container Registry. Dets anvendelsesområde er autentificering, oprydning og andre GHCR- specifikke operationelle problemer i lageret."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for GitHub governance and repository controls. Its scope is branch protection, repository settings, GitHub Actions workflows and variables, and other platform rules that affect contributions."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder bidragydende vejledning for GitHub styring og lagerstyring. Dens omfang er grenbeskyttelse, depotindstillinger, GitHub Handlinger arbejdsgange og variabler, og andre platform regler, der påvirker bidrag."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for Infinito.Nexus shared services. Its scope is the model that defines how shared services are declared, discovered, loaded, injected, and consumed, plus the per-service contracts that role authors and consumers MUST follow."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder vejledning for bidragydere Infinito.Nexus fælles tjenester. Dens anvendelsesområde er den model, der definerer, hvordan delte tjenester er erklæret, opdaget, indlæst, injiceret og forbrugt, plus de per- service kontrakter, der rolle forfattere og forbrugere SKAL følge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for automated tests. Its scope is how lint, unit, integration, regression, and Playwright coverage should be structured, selected, and validated."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder bidragydende vejledning for automatiserede test. Dens anvendelsesområde er, hvordan lint, enhed, integration, regression, og Playwright dækning skal struktureres, vælges og valideres."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for code design and implementation. Its scope is architecture, service wiring, coding principles, exceptions, and the boundaries that shape maintainable changes."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder bidragsydervejledning for kodedesign og implementering. Dens anvendelsesområde er arkitektur, service ledninger, kodning principper, undtagelser, og grænserne, der former vedvarende ændringer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for container image artefacts. Its scope is how images are declared, discovered, mirrored, and maintained across the repository and CI flow."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder bidragydende vejledning for container image artefacts. Dens omfang er, hvordan billeder deklareres, opdages, spejles og vedligeholdes på tværs af lageret og CI flow."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for local environments. Its scope is setup, supported operating systems, variables, and resource constraints for running the project safely on a workstation."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder vejledning for bidragydere til lokale miljøer. Dens anvendelsesområde er opsætning, understøttede operativsystemer, variabler og ressourcebegrænsninger for at køre projektet sikkert på en arbejdsstation."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for project tools. Its scope is how repository-standard tools should be used, when they apply, and where they fit into the wider workflow."
msgstr "Denne fortegnelse indeholder vejledning for bidragydere til projektværktøjer. Dens anvendelsesområde er, hvordan datalagringsstandardværktøjer skal anvendes, når de anvendes, og hvor de passer ind i den bredere arbejdsgang."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for team collaboration, communication, and organisational processes. Its scope is how contributors communicate, document their work, and apply agile principles across the project lifecycle."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder vejledning for teamsamarbejde, kommunikation og organisatoriske processer. Dets anvendelsesområde er, hvordan bidragydere kommunikerer, dokumenterer deres arbejde og anvender agile principper i hele projektets livscyklus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for Ansible lookup plugins under [plugins/lookup/](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/). Its scope is how the project exposes merged configuration data to runtime consumers without materializing repository-wide facts."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder bidragsregler for Ansible lookup- plugins under [plugins / lookup /](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/). Dens anvendelsesområde er, hvordan projektet udsætter fusionerede konfigurationsdata til runtime forbrugere uden at materialisere datalager-brede fakta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for Git-managed artefacts and CI/CD pipeline conventions. Its scope is how branches, commits, pull requests, the CI/CD pipeline, and the maintainer's fork-based remote layout MUST be structured and used in this repository."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder bidragsregler for Git-forvaltede artefakter og CI / CD rørledningskonventioner. Dens anvendelsesområde er, hvordan filialer, forpligter, trækker anmodninger, CI / CD-rørledningen, og vedligeholderens gaffelbaserede fjernlayout SKAL struktureres og bruges i dette arkiv."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for `README.md` files stored inside documentation directories. Its scope is purpose, scope, and navigation behavior for docs-scoped READMEs."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder bidragsregler for `README.md` filer gemt i dokumentationsmapper. Dens omfang er formål, omfang og navigation adfærd for docs-scoped READMs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for files under [plugins/](../../../../../plugins/). Its scope is how Ansible plugin sources MUST be structured so that runtime consumers, tests, and documentation stay aligned."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder bidragsregler for filer under [plugins /](../../../../../plugins/). Dens omfang er, hvordan Ansible plugin kilder SKAL struktureres, så runtime forbrugere, tests, og dokumentation forblive på linje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for project artefacts. Its scope is how repository-managed files and generated delivery artefacts should be documented, structured, and maintained."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder bidragsregler for projektartefakter. Dens omfang er, hvordan datalageret-forvaltede filer og genereret levering artefakter skal dokumenteres, struktureres og vedligeholdes."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for role-local files. Its scope is how key artefacts inside roles should be written so generated behavior, documentation, and frontend overrides stay consistent."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder bidragsregler for lokale filer. Dens omfang er, hvordan centrale artefakter inde roller skal skrives så genereret adfærd, dokumentation, og frontend tilsidesætter forblive konsekvent."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for specific repository file types. Its scope is authoring expectations for human-facing files whose structure and meaning must stay consistent across the project."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder bidragsregler for specifikke arkivfiltyper. Dets anvendelsesområde giver mulighed for forventninger til menneskelige filer, hvis struktur og betydning skal forblive konsekvent i hele projektet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor workflow guidance. Its scope is branch strategy, commits, testing, local deploys, CI, review, pull requests, releases, and the end-to-end path from local change to merged contribution."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder vejledning til bidragsydere i arbejdsgange. Dens anvendelsesområde er filialstrategi, forpligter, test, lokale programmer, CI, gennemgang, trække anmodninger, udgivelser, og end-to-end sti fra lokal forandring til fusioneret bidrag."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor-facing repository rules and workflows. Its scope is how humans and agents set up the environment, write documentation, communicate, define requirements, and contribute safely through the project lifecycle."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder regler og arbejdsgange, der står over for bidragydere. Dets anvendelsesområde er, hvordan mennesker og agenter etablerer miljøet, skriver dokumentation, kommunikerer, definerer krav og bidrager sikkert gennem projektets livscyklus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains custom **Ansible filter plugins** used within the Infinito.Nexus project."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder brugerdefinerede **Name** anvendes inden for Infinito.Nexus projekt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains custom **Ansible lookup plugins** used within the Infinito.Nexus project."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder brugerdefinerede **Name** anvendes inden for Infinito.Nexus projekt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains debugging guidance for contributor workflows. Its scope is how to investigate failures in CI, networking, and related development loops."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder fejlretningsvejledning for bidragsyderarbejdsgange. Dens omfang er, hvordan man undersøger fejl i CI, netværk og relaterede udvikling loops."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains default variable definition files for the `svc-db-mariadb` Ansible role. It centralizes all configurable values related to MariaDB deployment and can be adjusted without modifying task logic."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder standard variable definitionsfiler for `svc-db-mariadb` Ansidelig rolle. Det centraliserer alle konfigurerbare værdier relateret til MariaDB implementering og kan justeres uden at ændre opgavelogi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains documentation for contributors working alongside AI coding agents in this project. It covers shared agent guidelines that apply regardless of the AI tool used, as well as tool-specific permission references and security rationale for each supported agent."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder dokumentation for bidragydere, der arbejder sammen med AI-kodningsagenter i dette projekt. Det omfatter fælles agent retningslinjer, der gælder uanset AI værktøj, samt værktøjs- specifikke tilladelse referencer og sikkerhed begrundelse for hver understøttet agent."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains gating helpers that decide whether a tagged commit is eligible for release. The current gate enforces that the version-tag commit is contained in `origin/main`, so version tags pushed from feature branches cannot trigger a release. Helpers MUST be invoked from release-related workflows only and MUST NOT be treated as a substitute for branch protection; the gate is an additional check on top of, not a replacement for, the repository's branch-protection rules."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder gating hjælpere, der beslutter, om en mærket commit er berettiget til frigivelse. Den nuværende gate håndhæver, at version- tag commit er indeholdt i `origin/main`, så version tags skubbet fra funktionen filialer kan ikke udløse en udgivelse. Hjælpere skal kun gøres gældende fra de arbejdsgange, der er forbundet hermed, og må ikke behandles som en erstatning for filialbeskyttelse; porten er en yderligere kontrol oven på, ikke en erstatning for, lagerets branchbeskyttelsesregler."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains generic wait and polling scripts used by workflow automation."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder generiske vente- og valgscripts, der bruges af workflow automatisering."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains helper scripts and binaries that are installed on the host to provide **container-related runtime functionality** for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder helper scripts og binære filer, der er installeret på værten for at give **containerrelateret runtime-funktionalitet** til Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains helpers invoked from workflows that listen on `pull_request_target`, `push`, and `delete`. The helpers call the GitHub Actions API to cancel runs made obsolete by a closed PR, a deleted branch, or a newer commit on the same PR or branch. Helpers MUST NOT be called from workflows that have not received one of those events, because cancelling unrelated runs would mask real failures and waste accumulated work."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder hjælpere, der er henvist fra arbejdsgange, der lytter til `pull_request_target`, `push`, og `delete`. Hjælpere kalder GitHub-aktionerne API at annullere kørsler gjort forældede af en lukket PR, en slettet filial, eller en nyere commit på samme PR eller gren. Hjælper SKAL IKKE kaldes fra arbejdsgange, der ikke har modtaget en af disse begivenheder, fordi aflysning af ikke-relaterede løb ville maskere reelle fejl og affald akkumuleret arbejde."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains helpers that mutate persistent on-host state during purge flows."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder hjælpere, der muterer vedvarende on- værtsstat under udrensningen strømme."

msgid "This directory contains host-level helpers: disk-space reclamation and reporting, a free-space guard that stops a step before the runner's root disk fills, swap-file enlargement, Docker-daemon cleanup, and post-failure diagnostic dumps. Helpers MUST be invoked from workflow `run:` blocks under [`.github/workflows/`](../../../.github/workflows/) and MUST NOT be called from application code, Ansible roles, or any runtime path outside CI. They assume a GitHub-hosted Ubuntu runner and modify host-kernel state (mount points, swap, Docker storage) that does not exist inside the `infinito` container."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains language-specific coding guidance. Its scope is conventions that only apply to particular implementation languages when the general code rules need narrower detail."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder sprogspecifik kodningsvejledning. Dens anvendelsesområde er konventioner, der kun finder anvendelse på bestemte gennemførelsessprog, når de generelle koderegler kræver snævrere detaljer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains operational documentation for the Nextcloud role in Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Denne fortegnelse indeholder operationel dokumentation for Nextcloud rolle i Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific environment setup guidance. Its scope is operating-system differences that affect local development and execution."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder platform- specifikke miljøopsætningsvejledning. Dens anvendelsesområde er operationelle systemforskelle, der påvirker den lokale udvikling og gennemførelse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific scripts for enabling systemd in environments where it is not active by default. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder platformspecifikke scripts til at aktivere systemd i miljøer, hvor det ikke er aktivt som standard. For den kanoniske Make mål indeks, der påkalder disse hjælpere, se [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific scripts for setting up local DNS resolution for the `infinito.test` domain (and subdomains) on the development machine."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder platformspecifikke scripts til opsætning af lokal DNS-opløsning til `infinito.test` domæne (og underområder) på udviklingsmaskinen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific scripts for trusting the Infinito Root CA certificate on the developer's machine. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder platformspecifikke scripts til at stole på Infinito Root CA certifikat på udviklerens maskine. For den kanoniske Make mål indeks, der påkalder disse hjælpere, se [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains project requirements documents. Its scope is user stories and acceptance criteria that define what the project must do and that guide agent-assisted implementation."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder projektdokumenter. Anvendelsesområdet er brugerhistorier og acceptkriterier, der definerer, hvad projektet skal gøre, og som er vejledende for en målrettet gennemførelse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains project-specific Ansible modules used by Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder projektspecifikke Ansible moduler, der bruges af Infinito.Nexus."

msgid "This directory contains pure resolvers that read repository state (git history, role metadata, version tags, input environment variables) and emit resolved values either via `$GITHUB_OUTPUT` or stdout. Resolvers MUST be idempotent and MUST NOT mutate repository or registry state beyond writing to `$GITHUB_OUTPUT`. The covered concerns are diff-driven app whitelist resolution, the `🧩 Subset` label dispatch (`pr_affected_roles.sh`, which picks between the PR-body subset and the diff resolver), release-tag detection, app discovery for the deploy matrix, the count of leading batches that hold priority rows (`priority_batches.sh`, which stars those batches' job names), and change detection that gates the update pipeline."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains repository-specific resolvers used across workflows and shell helpers."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder repository- specifikke resolvers, der bruges på tværs af arbejdsgange og shell hjælpere."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains resolver scripts for detecting missing derived artifacts and release metadata."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder resolver scripts til at opdage manglende afledte artefakter og frigive metadata."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts for managing TLS/PKI concerns in the Infinito Nexus development environment. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder scripts til håndtering af TLS / PKI bekymringer i Infinito Nexus udviklingsmiljø. For den kanoniske Make mål indeks, der påkalder disse hjælpere, se [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts for managing systemd across different platforms and environments used in Infinito Nexus development. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder scripts til styring af systemd på tværs af forskellige platforme og miljøer, der anvendes i Infinito Nexus udvikling. For den kanoniske Make mål indeks, der påkalder disse hjælpere, se [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts related to the image lifecycle used by the project."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder scripts relateret til billedet livscyklus, der anvendes af projektet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts that install and bootstrap host-side tooling used by the project."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder scripts, der installerer og bootstrap host- side tooling bruges af projektet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts that resolve metadata and derived values used by the project."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder scripts der løser metadata og afledte værdier der bruges af projektet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts that run repository lint checks."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder scripts, der kører datalager lintkontrol."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains security guidance for Infinito.Nexus users and administrators. Its scope is operational security expectations, reporting paths, and role-specific hardening advice."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder sikkerhedsvejledning for Infinito.Nexus brugere og administratorer. Dens anvendelsesområde er operationelle sikkerhedsforventninger, rapporteringsveje og rolespecifikke hærdningsråd."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains shared Python helpers used by custom modules and plugins."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder delte Python hjælpere, der bruges af brugerdefinerede moduler og plugins."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the AppArmor-facing maintenance layer for the local and CI development experience."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder den AppArmor- front vedligeholdelseslag for den lokale og CI udvikling erfaring."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the [Ansible](https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_variables.html) `group_vars` applied to every host in the inventory. It holds the shared baseline that every role and every host-specific var can build on top of."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder [Ansible](https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_variables.html) `group_vars` anvendes på hver vært i fortegnelsen. Det holder den delte basis, som hver rolle og hver vært-specifikke var kan bygge oven på."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the helpers invoked by [cron-update.yml](../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) to bump pinned upstream versions and open a pull request once per day. The helpers are thin wrappers: the image-version and repository-ref bumpers delegate to Python CLIs under [cli/contributing/](../../../cli/contributing/) that scan `roles/*/meta/services.yml` and rewrite version pins in place; the PR-open helper commits, force-pushes the update branch, and creates or refreshes the PR via `gh`. Helpers MUST NOT be called from workflows other than `🔄 Update versions`; the `CI_ENABLE_AUTO_UPDATES` gate is enforced once, at the workflow's job level, and bypassing it from another caller would create PRs even when auto-updates are intentionally disabled."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder de hjælpere, der påberåbes af [cron-update.yml](../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) at støde fastklemte opstrømsversioner og åbne en pull anmodning én gang om dagen. Hjælpere er tynde wrappers: image- version og repository- ref kofangere delegeret til Python CLIs under [cli / bidragende /](../../../cli/contributing/) scan `roles/*/meta/services.yml` og omskrive versionspins på plads; PR- open helper forpligter, kraft- skubber opdateringsgrenen, og skaber eller genopfrisker PR via `gh`. Hjælper må ikke kaldes fra andre arbejdsgange end `🔄 Update versions`; `CI_ENABLE_AUTO_UPDATES` Gate håndhæves én gang, på workflow job niveau, og omgå det fra en anden ringer ville skabe PRs, selv når auto-opdateringer er bevidst deaktiveret."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the modular workspace test suite for Infinito.Nexus. It validates the full local development flow from a clean state. In CI it runs exactly like that flow, except that it pulls images through the GHCR mirror (`INFINITO_GHCR_MIRROR=true`, see [mirror.md](../../../docs/contributing/artefact/image/mirror.md))."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder den modulære workspace test suite til Infinito.Nexus. Det validerer den fulde lokale udvikling flow fra en ren tilstand. I CI kører det præcis som det flow, bortset fra at det trækker billeder gennem GHCR spejl (`INFINITO_GHCR_MIRROR=true`, se [mirror.md](../../../docs/contributing/artefact/image/mirror.md))."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the repository documentation published for Infinito.Nexus. Its scope is contributor guidance, agent instructions, operational guides, requirements, and security guidance across the project."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder den arkivdokumentation, der er offentliggjort for Infinito.Nexus. Dets anvendelsesområde er bidragydende vejledning, agentvejledning, operationelle vejledninger, krav og sikkerhedsvejledning på tværs af projektet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the shared environment bootstrap layer for Infinito.Nexus scripts. ✨"
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder det delte miljø bootstrap lag til Infinito.Nexus manuskripter. ✨"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the shell helpers that [entry-pr-translate.yml](../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-translate.yml) calls: resolving the languages LibreTranslate supports into the job matrix, merging the source strings of the `core` and `docs` domains into `locale/`, and machine-translating one language per runner."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder de shell hjælpere, der [entry-pr-translate.yml](../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-translate.yml) opkald: løsning af sprog LibreTranslate understøtter ind i job matrix, fletning af kilden strenge af `core` og `docs` domæner ind `locale/`, og maskin- oversætte et sprog per løber."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains variable definition files for the `svc-db-mariadb` Ansible role. It centralizes all configurable values related to MariaDB deployment and can be adjusted without modifying task logic."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder filer med variabel definition til `svc-db-mariadb` Ansidelig rolle. Det centraliserer alle konfigurerbare værdier relateret til MariaDB implementering og kan justeres uden at ændre opgavelogi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains workstation bundle skeletons."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder arbejdsstation bundt skeletter."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory documents GitHub Actions in this repository."
msgstr "Denne mappe dokumenterer GitHub Handlinger i dette arkiv."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory follows the same high-level structure as `package-manager`:"
msgstr "Denne mappe følger samme struktur på højt niveau som `package-manager`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds DNS helpers used during development and environment preparation. The folder contains the local name-resolution setup and teardown logic used during development and environment preparation. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder DNS-hjælpere, der bruges under udvikling og miljøforberedelse. Mappen indeholder den lokale navnesolution setup og teardown logik, der anvendes under udvikling og miljøforberedelse. For den kanoniske Make mål indeks, der påkalder disse hjælpere, se [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds Docker-related network helpers. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder Docker- relaterede netværk hjælpere. For den kanoniske Make mål indeks, der påkalder disse hjælpere, se [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds IPv6 enable and restore helpers for local development. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md). For the generic stack refresh helper used by `make network-refresh`, see [../docker/README.md](../docker/README.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder IPv6 aktivere og genoprette hjælpere til lokal udvikling. For den kanoniske Make mål indeks, der påkalder disse hjælpere, se [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md). For den generiske stack refresh hjælper bruges af `make network-refresh`, se [../docker/README.md](../docker/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds PHP files that the [web-app-wordpress](../../) role copies into the running container at `/var/www/html/wp-content/mu-plugins/`."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder PHP- filer som [web-app-wordpress](../../) rollekopier i den løbende beholder på `/var/www/html/wp-content/mu-plugins/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds container-side helpers grouped by area. Use the README in each child directory as the canonical entry point for that area. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder containersidehjælpere grupperet efter område. Brug README i hver børnemappe som det kanoniske indgangspunkt for dette område. For den kanoniske Make mål indeks, der påkalder disse hjælpere, se [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds host and system cleanup helpers. For container-local cleanup helpers, see [../../container/purge/README.md](../../container/purge/README.md). For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder vært og system oprydning hjælpere. For container- lokale oprydning hjælpere, se [../../container/purge/README.md](../../container/purge/README.md). For den kanoniske Make mål indeks, der påkalder disse hjælpere, se [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds network helpers grouped by area. Use the child README files for the DNS, Docker, and IPv6 details. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder netværkshjælpere grupperet efter område. Brug barnet README filer til DNS, Docker, og IPv6 detaljer. For den kanoniske Make mål indeks, der påkalder disse hjælpere, se [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds system-facing helpers grouped by area. Use the README in each child directory as the canonical entry point for that area. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder system- vender hjælpere grupperet efter område. Brug README i hver børnemappe som det kanoniske indgangspunkt for dette område. For den kanoniske Make mål indeks, der påkalder disse hjælpere, se [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the Git workflow helper scripts. These helpers own the Git operations that the Claude sandbox denies, so they run under the operator's control with access to `~/.gnupg` and interactive `pinentry`. For the canonical command index, see [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder Git workflow hjælper scripts. Disse hjælpere ejer Git operationer, som Claude sandkassen benægter, så de kører under operatørens kontrol med adgang til `~/.gnupg` og interaktiv `pinentry`. For det kanoniske kommandoindeks, se [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the architecture decision records of Infinito.Nexus. A record states one decision that shapes the system, the forces that constrain it, and what living with it costs."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder arkitekturbeslutningsjournaler over Infinito.Nexus. En rekord siger en beslutning, der former systemet, de kræfter, der begrænser det, og hvad det koster at leve med det."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the cleanup helpers under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/`. For other local helpers, use [../README.md](../README.md). For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder oprydningshjælpere under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/`. For andre lokale hjælpere, brug [../README.md](../README.md). For den kanoniske Make mål indeks, der påkalder disse hjælpere, se [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the container execution helpers under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/`. For other local helpers, use [../README.md](../README.md). For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder containerudførelseshjælpere under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/`. For andre lokale hjælpere, brug [../README.md](../README.md). For den kanoniske Make mål indeks, der påkalder disse hjælpere, se [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the contributor guidance for how Infinito.Nexus integrates applications with the shared identity providers, Keycloak (OIDC) and OpenLDAP. Read the pages here before adding or changing any login, user-provisioning, or role-mapping code in a role."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder bidragsydervejledningen for hvordan Infinito.Nexus integrerer applikationer med de delte identitetsudbydere Keycloak (OIDC) og OpenLDAP. Læs siderne her, før du tilføjer eller ændrer nogen login, user- proviing, eller role- mapping kode i en rolle."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the executable CI deploy flows under `scripts/tests/deploy/ci/`."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder de eksekverbare CI-deployeringsstrømme under `scripts/tests/deploy/ci/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the executable act deploy flows under `scripts/tests/deploy/act/`."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder de eksekverbare aktions deployeringsstrømme under `scripts/tests/deploy/act/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the executable local deploy flows under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/deploy/`."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder de eksekverbare lokale implementeringsstrømme under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/deploy/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This directory holds the in-container halves of the local deploy flows. Each script runs inside the development compose container (the repo is bind-mounted at `${INFINITO_SRC_DIR}`) and is invoked by a matching host wrapper under [apps/](../apps/README.md)."
msgstr "Denne mappe indeholder in- container halvdele af de lokale deployeringsstrømme. Hvert script kører inde i udviklingen komponere container (repo er binde- monteret på `${INFINITO_SRC_DIR}`) og påberåbes af en matchende vært wrapper under [apps /](../apps/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the inventory refresh helpers under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/reset/`. For other local helpers, use [../README.md](../README.md). For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
