msgstr "Denne side dokumenterer kontrakten `email` Ansible lookup plugin og reglerne bidragydere SKAL følge, når udvide det eller forbruge det fra en rolle. Til konfigurering af administratorvendt (taster, override variabler, forrang), se [email.md](../../../../administration/configuration/email.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page documents the permission and runtime configuration in [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json). For the trust assumptions and the two-layer containment model behind these rules, see [security.md](security.md). For the OS-level sandbox configuration, see [sandbox.md](sandbox.md). For general agent workflow rules, see [common.md](../common.md). For the Claude Code reference, see [docs.claude.com](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/settings)."
msgstr "Denne side dokumenterer tilladelse og runtime konfiguration i [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json). For de tillid antagelser og to-lag indeslutning model bag disse regler, se [security.md](security.md). For OS- niveau sandkasse konfiguration, se [sandbox.md](sandbox.md). For generelle agent workflow regler, se [common.md](../common.md). For den Claude Code reference, se [docs.claude.com](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/settings)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page documents the rules that govern the top-level [compose.yml](../../../../compose.yml) and the environment variables it consumes. For general documentation rules (links, writing, RFC 2119 keywords), see [documentation.md](../../documentation.md). For CI debugging workflows that use these variables, see [ci.md](../../actions/debugging/ci.md)."
msgstr "Denne side dokumenterer de regler, der styrer topniveauet [compose.yml](../../../../compose.yml) og de miljøvariabler, det forbruger. Regler for generel dokumentation (links, skrivning, RFC 2119 Nøgleord), se [documentation.md](../../documentation.md). For CI debugging arbejdsgange, der bruger disse variabler, se [ci.md](../../actions/debugging/ci.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page enumerates the trust assumptions that the Claude Code configuration in [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json) relies on. If any assumption becomes false on a given host, the corresponding rule in [settings.md](settings.md) or [sandbox.md](sandbox.md) MUST be re-evaluated before Claude Code is started. This file is the single reference for the architectural reasoning. Per-rule tables in the neighbouring pages summarise the mechanics and link here for the full argument."
msgstr "Denne side opregner de tillid antagelser, at Claude Code konfiguration i [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json) Stoler på. Hvis nogen antagelse bliver falsk på en given vært, den tilsvarende regel i [settings.md](settings.md) eller [sandbox.md](sandbox.md) Skal revurderes, før Claude Code startes. Denne fil er den eneste reference til det arkitektoniske ræsonnement. Per- regel tabeller på nabosiderne sammenfatter mekanikken og link her for det fulde argument."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page enumerates the values the `meta/services.yml.<entity>.lifecycle` key MAY take and what each value commits the project to. The on-disk shape of `lifecycle` itself is documented in [layout.md](layout.md); this page is the semantic counterpart."
msgstr "Denne side optæller værdierne `meta/services.yml.<entity>.lifecycle` nøgle MAJ tage og hvad hver værdi forpligter projektet til. On- disk form af `lifecycle` selv er dokumenteret i [layout.md](layout.md); denne side er det semantiske modstykke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
