msgid "This role deploy Decidim, an open-source participatory democracy platform for public consultations, civic processes, community voting, and collaborative policy creation."
msgstr "Denne rolle deployering Decidim, en åben kilde deltagelsesdemokrati platform for offentlige høringer, borgerlige processer, lokalvalg, og samarbejde politik skabelse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **LibreTranslate** as a containerized web service using Docker Compose. It is designed to integrate seamlessly into the Infinito.Nexus stack, including optional Redis and database backends, CSP handling, and analytics integration."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig **LibreTranslate** som en containerbaseret webtjeneste, der bruger Docker ComposeDet er designet til at integrere problemfrit i Infinito.Nexus stack, herunder valgfri Redis og database backends, CSP håndtering, og analytics integration."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **LibreTranslate** as a plain translation engine, without a public vhost, reverse proxy, MCP adapter or analytics. Callers reach it over the container network and talk to its HTTP API directly."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig **LibreTranslate** som en almindelig oversættelse motor, uden en offentlig vhost, reverse proxy, MCP adapter eller analytics. Opkaldene nå det over containeren netværk og tale med sin HTTP API direkte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Magento 2** via Docker Compose. It is aligned with the Infinito.Nexus stack patterns:"
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig **Magento 2** via Docker ComposeDet er i overensstemmelse med Infinito.Nexus stabelmønstre:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak's user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig **Shopware 6** anvendelse **Docker**. Det automatiserer installation, migration, og konfiguration af din butiksfacade, integrere med en central **MariaDB** database. Valgfrie komponenter som **Redis** og **OpenSearch** forbedre performance og søgemuligheder, mens **OIDC** integrerer administrationens motor med **Keycloak**. Mappekonti tegn på samme måde: Shopware har ingen admin- LDAP udvidelse denne rolle kan installere, så LDAP identiteter ankommer gennem Keycloak's bruger føderation snarere end gennem et plugin af deres egen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak’s user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
