# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys a self-hosted Bluesky stack on Docker Compose. It runs the official PDS container as the user-data layer, builds the upstream `@bluesky-social/social-app` web client as the user-facing UI, and adds an in-role login-broker sidecar that gates the web client through Keycloak via `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar. The broker auto-provisions PDS accounts for incoming OIDC users, holds the synthesised app-password AES-256-GCM-encrypted in a process-local cache, and drops a usable PDS session into the social-app's local storage so end users never see the synthesised credential."
msgstr "Denne rolle giver en selvvært Bluesky stack on Docker Compose. Det kører den officielle PDS beholder som bruger- data lag, bygger opstrøms `@bluesky-social/social-app` web-klient som bruger-vender UI, og tilføjer en in- rollelogin- mægler sidevogn, der låser web-klient gennem Keycloak via `web-app-keycloak`SO- proxysidevogn. Mægleren autoprovisions PDS konti for indgående OIDC-brugere, besidder den syntetiserede app- password AES-256-GM- krypteret i en proces- lokale cache, og smider en brugbar PDS session i den sociale app lokale lagring, så slutbrugerne aldrig se den syntetiserede kreditværdighed."

