# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is focused on installing JDK 11, but it can be easily modified to install different versions of the JDK or additional Java-related tools as per your requirements."
msgstr "Denne rolle er fokuseret på at installere JDK 11, men det kan nemt ændres at installere forskellige versioner af JDK eller yderligere Java-relaterede værktøjer som pr dine krav."

