# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) for the app frontend, or ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for named sidecars (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app runs node-local under swarm and publishes its local port to the host, so the overlay-attached proxy reaches it at ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via the host gateway (the caller sets this off the real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, since such apps force a compose-style render). Missing swarm internal port hard-fails."
msgstr "Upstream ``host:port``: komponér ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; sværm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared- overlay alias) for appen frontend, eller ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for navngivne sidevogne (sso- proxy)A ``host_gateway`` app kører node- lokale under sværm og udgiver sin lokale port til værten, så den overliggende proxy når det på ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via værtsgateway (Den, der ringer, sætter det her af. DEPLOYMENT_MODE, da sådanne apps tvinge en kompositstil render). Manglende sværm intern port hard- mislykkes."

