msgid "Walk a (possibly nested) credentials schema and emit one vault block per scalar leaf into ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse into nested CommentedMaps so each leaf becomes its own vault-encrypted entry instead of being collapsed via ``str(dict)`` into a Python-repr blob (the regression that broke run 26428080957 jobs 77797371397 and 77797371442 for web-app-espocrm and web-app-listmonk)."
msgstr "Gå en (eventuelt indlejret) legitimation skema og udsende en hvælving blok pr skalar blad i ``dest_node``. Nøgne dicks (F.eks. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse innested CommentedMaps så hvert blad bliver sin egen vault- krypteret indgang i stedet for at blive kollapset via ``str(dict)`` ind i en Python- repr blob (regression, der brød løb 26428080957 job 77797371397 og 77797371442 til web-app-espocrm og web-app-listmonk)."

