# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Whole namespace asked: `logout` is operator-scope DoS; `token` prints the OAuth/PAT to stdout where it would land in the transcript permanently if approved (operator MUST decline unless they explicitly want the token captured); `switch` silently changes the active identity; `setup-git` rewrites global git config; `login`/`refresh`/`status` are lower-risk but kept inside the same gate for symmetry. The trade-off vs. an explicit `deny` on `logout`/`token` is that approval is now a single click; operators must read the prompt before tapping through."
msgstr "Hele navnerummet spurgte: `logout` er operator- scope DoS `token` printer OAuth / PAT til stdout, hvor det ville lande permanent i udskriften, hvis godkendt (luftfartsforetagendet SKAL falde, medmindre de udtrykkeligt ønsker, at token indfanget); `switch` stille ændrer den aktive identitet `setup-git` omskriver global git config; `login`/`refresh`/`status` er lavere risiko, men holdes inde i samme port for symmetri. Handel mod en udtrykkelig `deny` om `logout`/`token` er, at godkendelse nu er et enkelt klik; operatører skal læse prompten, før du trykker igennem."

