msgid "You MUST use [agents.md](https://agents.md/) as the external meta reference for AGENTS files."
msgstr "De skal bruge: [agents.md](https://agents.md/) som den eksterne metareference for AGENS- filer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use `# nocheck: docker-version` directly above a `version:` key only for intentional exceptions that should not be flagged by the external image-version check."
msgstr "De skal bruge: `# nocheck: docker-version` direkte over a `version:` nøgle kun for forsætlige undtagelser, der ikke bør markeres ved den eksterne image- version kontrol."

