# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[LTEngine](https://github.com/LibreTranslate/LTEngine) is a machine translation server that speaks the LibreTranslate API and answers it with a local large language model through [llama.cpp](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp). Translation quality for many pairs is higher than a lightweight transformer model reaches, at the cost of memory and latency."
msgstr "[LTEngine](https://github.com/LibreTranslate/LTEngine) er en maskine oversættelse server, der taler LibreTranslate API og besvarer det med en lokal stor sprogmodel gennem [llama.cpp](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp). Oversættelse kvalitet for mange par er højere end en letvægts transformator model når, på bekostning af hukommelse og latency."

