# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[atmo.rsvp](https://atmo.rsvp) is an open-source, AT-Protocol-native event platform. Its defining property is that **events live on the user's account, not on the app**: an event is a `community.lexicon.calendar.event` record and an RSVP is a `community.lexicon.calendar.rsvp` record, both stored in the user's Personal Data Server (PDS) repo. The atmo app itself is \"just a view\" (an appview/aggregator) over those records, so RSVPs and events are portable across any app on the open social web."
msgstr "[atmo.rsvp](https://atmo.rsvp) er en open- source, AT- Protocol- native event platform. Dens afgørende egenskab er, at **begivenheder lever på brugerens konto, ikke på appen**: en begivenhed er en `community.lexicon.calendar.event` record og en RSVP er en `community.lexicon.calendar.rsvp` record, begge gemt i brugerens Personlige Data Server (PDS) repo. Den atmo app selv er \"bare en visning\" (en appview / aggregator) over disse optegnelser, så RSVP og begivenheder er bærbare på tværs af enhver app på det åbne sociale web."

