:846-853`). Proven by `TestNextcloudAdminClientRole` and `test_the_default_plugins_render_the_realm_byte_identically` in [test_backchannel_clients.py](../../tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-keycloak/templates/test_backchannel_clients.py), `TestDeclaredClientRoleGrants` in `tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-keycloak/filter_plugins/test_oidc_clients.py`, and `test_the_admin_client_role_provisions_nextcloud_s_admin_group` with its negative control in `tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-nextcloud/test_user_oidc_provider.py`. The live sign-in belongs to the Playwright criterion below."
