msgid "`JELLYFIN_*` env (double-underscore nesting), `JELLYFIN_PublishedServerUrl`, `TZ`; runs as `PUID/PGID`."
msgstr "`JELLYFIN_*` env (dobbelt-underscore redening), `JELLYFIN_PublishedServerUrl`, `TZ`; kører som `PUID/PGID`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jellyfin <https://jellyfin.org>`__ is a free, open-source media server. This role deploys the official ``jellyfin/jellyfin`` container behind the Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy, with Keycloak OIDC (web) and central LDAP authentication provisioned via the Jellyfin auth plugins."
msgstr "`Jellyfin <https://jellyfin.org>`__ er en fri, opensource medieserver. Denne rolle udleder den officielle ``jellyfin/jellyfin`` container bag Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy, med Keycloak OIDC (web) og central LDAP autentificering leveres via Jellyfin Auth plugins."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jenkins <https://www.jenkins.io/>`__ is an open-source automation server that orchestrates the build, test, and deployment of software through pipelines, freestyle jobs, and a large plugin ecosystem."
msgstr "`Jenkins <https://www.jenkins.io/>`__ er en open-source automatisering server, der organiserer opbygning, test og implementering af software gennem rørledninger, freestyle job, og et stort plugin økosystem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jira <https://www.atlassian.com/>`__ is Atlassian’s issue and project-tracking platform. This role deploys Jira via Docker Compose, connects it to PostgreSQL, and adds proxy awareness, optional OIDC SSO, health checks, and production-oriented defaults for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "`Jira <https://www.atlassian.com/>`__ er Atlanssians problem og projekt- tracking platform. Denne rolle udspiller sig Jira via Docker Compose, forbinder det til PostgreSQL, og tilføjer proxy bevidsthed, valgfri OIDC SSO, sundhedskontrol, og produktions-orienterede standardværdier for Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jitsi Meet <https://jitsi.org/>`__ is an open-source, end-to-end-encryptable video conferencing platform. Rooms run over WebRTC with a central Selective Forwarding Unit (jvb), an XMPP server (prosody) for signalling, and a conference focus daemon (jicofo)."
msgstr "`Jitsi Meet <https://jitsi.org/>`__ er en åben-kilde, end-to-end-kryptabel video konference platform. Værelserne kører over WebRTC med en central Selektiv Forwarding Unit (jvb), en XMPP server (prosody) for signalering, og en konference fokus dæmon (jicofoCity in Italy)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Joomla <https://www.joomla.org/>`__ is a free and open-source content management system that lets users build and run websites, intranets, and online applications without writing code. It exposes a component, module, and plugin architecture that authors and developers extend with custom content types, layouts, and integrations."
msgstr "`Joomla <https://www.joomla.org/>`__ er en gratis og opensource indhold management system, der lader brugerne bygge og køre hjemmesider, intranets, og online applikationer uden at skrive kode. Det udsætter en komponent, modul og plugin arkitektur, som forfattere og udviklere udvide med brugerdefinerede indhold typer, layouts, og integreringer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jrnl <https://jrnl.sh/>`__ is a simple and effective command-line journal application that allows users to create and manage personal journal entries."
msgstr "`Jrnl <https://jrnl.sh/>`__ er en enkel og effektiv kommandolinje tidsskrift program, der giver brugerne mulighed for at oprette og administrere personlige tidsskrift poster."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jupyter <https://jupyter.org/>`__ runs code in a managed kernel and returns its output. This role provides that kernel as a backend for other services rather than as a notebook UI for people."
msgstr "`Jupyter <https://jupyter.org/>`__ kører kode i en styret kerne og returnerer sin output. Denne rolle giver denne kerne som en motor for andre tjenester snarere end som en notesbog UI for mennesker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KEEP_NEWEST_PER` — keeps the newest run of each group instance alive and cancels only the older ones, which is the rule the concurrency group itself applies. It is what makes the fallback safe against races: the head SHA from the event payload goes stale while the job waits for a runner, and a `[skip ci]` or `GITHUB_TOKEN` push moves the branch tip without creating a run at all. Selecting by \"not the current head\" would then cancel the newest commit's CI and spare the stale one, or leave the branch with no CI at all. Selecting by \"not the newest run\" cannot, in any ordering."
msgstr "`KEEP_NEWEST_PER` - holder den nyeste køre af hver gruppe instans i live og annullerer kun de ældre, hvilket er reglen concurrent gruppe selv gælder. Det er, hvad der gør fallback sikker mod racer: hovedet SHA fra begivenheden nyttelasten går skævt, mens jobbet venter på en runner, og en `[skip ci]` eller `GITHUB_TOKEN` skubbe flytter grenspidsen uden at skabe en køre overhovedet. Valg ved \"ikke det aktuelle hoved\" vil derefter annullere den nyeste commit 's CI og spare den gamle en, eller forlade grenen uden CI overhovedet. Valg ved \"ikke den nyeste kørsel\" kan ikke, i nogen bestilling."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KEY` MUST be the owned variable's name."
msgstr "`KEY` Det må være variablens navn."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KIX Start <https://www.kixdesk.com/>`__ is an open-source IT service management and helpdesk platform forked from OTRS. It provides ticket management, configuration management, knowledge base, and reporting for IT service teams."
msgstr "`KIX Start <https://www.kixdesk.com/>`__ er en open-source it-service management og helpdesk platform, der er gemt fra OTRS. Det giver billet management, konfiguration management, videnbase, og rapportering for IT service teams."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Kata Containers <https://katacontainers.io/>`__ is an OCI container runtime that starts each container inside a lightweight virtual machine with its own kernel instead of sharing the host kernel. `gVisor <https://gvisor.dev/>`__ is a second isolating runtime, shipped as the single ``runsc`` binary, that intercepts container syscalls in a userspace kernel and runs without hardware virtualization."
msgstr "`Kata Containers <https://katacontainers.io/>`__ er en OCI container runtime, der starter hver beholder inde i en letvægts virtuel maskine med sin egen kerne i stedet for at dele værtskernen. `gVisor <https://gvisor.dev/>`__ er en anden isolerende runtime, afsendt som single ``runsc`` binær, der opfanger container syskaller i en userspace kerne og kører uden hardware virtualisering."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KeePassXC <https://keepassxc.org/>`__ is a free, open-source, cross-platform password manager that stores credentials in an encrypted local database compatible with the KeePass format."
msgstr "`KeePassXC <https://keepassxc.org/>`__ er en gratis, open-source, cross-platform password manager, der gemmer legitimation i en krypteret lokal database kompatibel med KeePass format."

