msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LM Studio <https://lmstudio.ai/>`__ is a runtime for open large language models. Its headless server mode loads models from a local store and answers chat and completion requests over an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API, so prompts and model weights stay on the machine that runs them."
msgstr "`LM Studio <https://lmstudio.ai/>`__ er en runtime for åbne store sprogmodeller. Dens hovedløse server mode indlæser modeller fra en lokal butik og besvarer chat og færdiggørelse anmodninger over en OpenAI- kompatibel HTTP API, så prompter og model vægte ophold på maskinen, der kører dem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LTEngine <https://github.com/LibreTranslate/LTEngine>`__ is a machine translation server that speaks the LibreTranslate API and answers it with a local large language model through `llama.cpp <https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp>`__. Translation quality for many pairs is higher than a lightweight transformer model reaches, at the cost of memory and latency."
msgstr "`LTEngine <https://github.com/LibreTranslate/LTEngine>`__ er en maskine oversættelse server, der taler LibreTranslate API og besvarer det med en lokal stor sprogmodel gennem `llama.cpp <https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp>`__. Oversættelse kvalitet for mange par er højere end en letvægts transformator model når, på bekostning af hukommelse og latency."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Laya <https://laya.aay.sh/>`__ is a local-first notification command center that aggregates Slack, mail, issue trackers and calendars into approvable action cards."
msgstr "`Laya <https://laya.aay.sh/>`__ er et local- first notification command center, der aggregerer Slack, mail, udstede trackers og kalendere til acceptable actionkort."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Lint and syntax checks` catch style, formatting, and Ansible syntax problems early."
msgstr "`Lint and syntax checks` fangst stil, formatering, og Ansible syntaks problemer tidligt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ is an LLM gateway that exposes an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API and forwards each request to a configured model backend, local or hosted. Clients authenticate with virtual API keys that the gateway issues and stores in its own database."
msgstr "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ er en LLM gateway, der udsætter en OpenAI- kompatibel HTTP API og videresender hver anmodning til en konfigureret modelmotor, lokal eller hostet. Klienter autentificere med virtuelle API nøgler, som portalen udsteder og gemmer i sin egen database."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ is an LLM gateway that puts a single OpenAI-compatible API in front of many model providers. Its admin UI is the gateway’s built-in web interface for virtual API keys, teams, budgets and rate limits, model routing, and request and spend logs."
msgstr "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ er en LLM gateway, der sætter en enkelt OpenAI- kompatibel API foran mange modeludbydere. Dens admin UI er gateways build- in web interface til virtuelle API nøgler, hold, budgetter og sats grænser, model routing, og anmode om og bruge logs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Local deploy and E2E validation` checks whether apps and deployment flows work in a realistic local stack."
msgstr "`Local deploy and E2E validation` kontrollerer, om apps og implementeringsstrømme fungerer i en realistisk lokal stak."

