# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ is a powerful source code editor with a wide plugin ecosystem, supporting development workflows across many languages and platforms. See also the `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ and general `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ on Wikipedia."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ er en kraftfuld kildekode editor med en bred plugin økosystem, der understøtter udvikling arbejdsgange på tværs af mange sprog og platforme. Se også `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ og generelt `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ på Wikipedia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ in a selectable flavor: the distribution’s Code - OSS build, VSCodium, or Microsoft’s own binary."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ i en selectable smag: fordelingen er Code - OSS build, VSCodium, eller Microsofts egen binær."

msgid "`WEBSERVER_SECURITY_HEADERS` in [04_webserver.yml](../../group_vars/all/04_webserver.yml) holds the platform values. A role overrides any key under `security_headers` in its `meta/server.yml`; an inventory overrides it at `applications.<role>.server.security_headers`."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`WM_TRUSTED_PROXY_CIDRS` must name the fronting proxy's network, otherwise `X-Forwarded-For` is ignored and the per-IP LLM cap (50 calls per UTC day) counts the proxy as one client. Invalid values stop the container."
msgstr "`WM_TRUSTED_PROXY_CIDRS` skal navngive proxyens netværk, ellers `X-Forwarded-For` er ignoreret og per-IP LLM cap (50 opkald pr. UTC- dag) tæller proxy som én klient. Ugyldige værdier stopper beholderen."

msgid "`Wazuh <https://wazuh.com/>`__ is an open-source SIEM and XDR platform providing security monitoring, log analysis, intrusion and vulnerability detection, and compliance support."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Weblate <https://weblate.org>`__ is a web-based continuous localization platform. It keeps a translation memory, glossaries and a review workflow, so a human translation can be written once, approved, and reused everywhere."
msgstr "`Weblate <https://weblate.org>`__ er en webbaseret kontinuerlig lokaliseringsplatform. Det holder en oversættelse hukommelse, glossarer og en gennemgang workflow, så en menneskelig oversættelse kan skrives én gang, godkendt, og genbruges overalt."

msgid "`WireGuard <https://www.wireguard.com/>`__ is an in-kernel VPN protocol. Peers authenticate each other with Curve25519 keypairs and exchange encrypted UDP datagrams, so a tunnel needs no session state, no certificate authority and no daemon of its own."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ is a versatile and widely used `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ that powers millions of websites, from blogs and portfolios to e-commerce and corporate sites. This deployment provides a containerized WordPress instance optimized for multisite operation, advanced media management, and extensive plugin support, allowing you to fully leverage the rich features of the WordPress software."
msgstr "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ er en alsidig og udbredt `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ at beføjelser millioner af hjemmesider, fra blogs og porteføljer til e-handel og corporate sites. Denne implementering giver en containerized WordPress instans optimeret til multisite operation, avanceret medieadministration, og omfattende plugin støtte, så du kan fuldt udnytte de rige funktioner i WordPress software."

msgid "`Workflows`: **Read and write** (the pushed `main` carries `.github/workflows/**`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "`World Monitor <https://github.com/koala73/worldmonitor>`__ is a real-time global intelligence dashboard. It plots public news, conflict, aviation, shipping, natural hazard and market feeds on an interactive map and in configurable panels, and can summarise the situation through a language model."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Zammad <https://zammad.org/>`__ is an open-source helpdesk and ticketing system. Agents handle customer requests across email, chat, phone and web; customers can open tickets from a self-service portal."
msgstr "`Zammad <https://zammad.org/>`__ er et open source helpdesk og billetsystem. Agenterne håndterer kundeforespørgsler på tværs af e-mail, chat, telefon og web; kunderne kan åbne billetter fra en selvbetjeningsportal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Zoom <https://zoom.us/>`__ is a popular video conferencing application for online meetings, webinars, and collaboration."
msgstr "`Zoom <https://zoom.us/>`__ er en populær video konference program til online møder, webinars, og samarbejde."

