msgstr "``$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProvider`` er ``open-ai``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``$wgAWSBucketDomain`` is the public ``objstore.public_url`` (scheme, the provider’s canonical API domain and the bucket path). The extension appends the zone root directory to it and prefixes ``https://`` only when the value carries no scheme, so a path-style value renders ``…/<bucket>/thumb`` correctly. ``services.seaweedfs.public: true`` grants the anonymous ``Read`` on that bucket the browser needs to fetch those URLs."
msgstr "``$wgAWSBucketDomain`` er offentligheden ``objstore.public_url`` (ordning, udbyderens kanoniske API domæne og skovlsti). Udvidelsen tilfører zonerodmappen til det og præfikser ``https://`` kun når værdien ikke bærer noget skema, så en path-stil værdi gør ``…/<bucket>/thumb`` Korrekt. ``services.seaweedfs.public: true`` giver anonyme ``Read`` på denne spand browseren har brug for at hente disse URL 'er."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``$wgAWSCredentials``, ``$wgAWSRegion`` and ``$wgAWSBucketName`` come from ``lookup('objstore', application_id, …)``, so the wiki signs with its own per-consumer identity from the engine’s ``s3.json``."
msgstr "``$wgAWSCredentials``, ``$wgAWSRegion`` og ``$wgAWSBucketName`` kommer fra ``lookup('objstore', application_id, …)``, så wiki tegn med sin egen per- forbruger identitet fra motoren ``s3.json``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``$wgEnableUploads`` follows the same flag. Extension:AWS only replaces ``$wgLocalFileRepo``; it opens no upload surface of its own, so without the object store the wiki keeps its uploads switched off rather than filling the local ``images`` volume."
msgstr "``$wgEnableUploads`` følger samme flag. Udvidelse: AWS erstatter kun ``$wgLocalFileRepo``; Det åbner ingen upload overflade af sin egen, så uden objektet butik wiki holder sine uploads slukket i stedet for at fylde den lokale ``images`` volumen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``$wgFileBackends['s3']['endpoint']`` is the in-cluster ``http://…:8333`` URL and ``$wgFileBackends['s3']['use_path_style_endpoint']`` is true. SeaweedFS serves buckets under a path, not a subdomain, so virtual-host addressing resolves nowhere. ``$wgAWSUseHTTPS`` is false for the same endpoint."
msgstr "``$wgFileBackends['s3']['endpoint']`` er in- klyngen ``http://…:8333`` URL og ``$wgFileBackends['s3']['use_path_style_endpoint']`` er sandt. SeaweedFS serverer spande under en sti, ikke et underdomæne, så virtual- host adressering løser ingen steder. ``$wgAWSUseHTTPS`` er falsk for det samme endepunkt."

