# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``files/build/config.php`` therefore assigns ``$CFG->curlsecurityblockedhosts`` from ``MOODLE_EGRESS_BLOCKED_HOSTS`` and ``$CFG->curlsecurityallowedport`` from ``MOODLE_EGRESS_ALLOWED_PORTS``, which carries the port of ``MOODLE_LITELLM_CHAT_ENDPOINT`` when the ``litellm`` service is enabled. Both arrive as comma-separated ``.env/env`` values and are expanded to the newline-separated form ``\\core\\files\\curl_security_helper`` expects. Loopback, ``0.0.0.0`` and the cloud metadata address stay blocked; the RFC1918 ranges are opened. The Docker address pool and the bridge gateway that serves the pinned Keycloak authority both live inside them."
msgstr "``files/build/config.php`` Derfor tildeler ``$CFG->curlsecurityblockedhosts`` fra ``MOODLE_EGRESS_BLOCKED_HOSTS`` og ``$CFG->curlsecurityallowedport`` fra ``MOODLE_EGRESS_ALLOWED_PORTS``, som fører havnen i ``MOODLE_LITELLM_CHAT_ENDPOINT`` når ``litellm`` service er aktiveret. Begge ankommer som kommasepareret ``.env/env`` værdier og udvides til den newlineseparerede form ``\\core\\files\\curl_security_helper`` Forventer. Loopback ``0.0.0.0`` og cloud metadataadressen forbliver blokeret; RFC1918 Intervaller åbnes. Den Docker adresse pool og broen gateway, der tjener fastspændt Keycloak autoritet begge lever inde i dem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``files/build/patch/tool-objectfs-path-style.patch`` forces ``use_path_style_endpoint`` on the AWS SDK client. The plugin exposes no setting for it and the SDK defaults a custom endpoint to virtual-host addressing, which SeaweedFS does not serve. ``files/build/install/tool-objectfs.sh`` applies it with ``patch -F0`` and fails the image build if the hunk no longer matches or if upstream starts setting the option itself."
msgstr "``files/build/patch/tool-objectfs-path-style.patch`` styrker ``use_path_style_endpoint`` på AWS SDK-klienten. Pluginet udsætter ingen indstilling for det og SDK standard en brugerdefineret endpoint til virtual- host adressering, som SeaweedFS ikke tjener. ``files/build/install/tool-objectfs.sh`` anvender det med ``patch -F0`` og mislykkes billedet bygge, hvis hunk ikke længere matcher, eller hvis opstrøms starter indstilling af selve indstillingen."

