# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`meta/addons/` declares the curated upstream plugins. `tasks/04_addons.yml` loops the entries whose `enabled` resolves true and hands each to `tasks/utils/addon.yml`, which drops the entries this node's architecture cannot run and passes the rest to `tasks/utils/addon/runnable.yml`. An entry with a `config.archive` is installed by `tasks/utils/addon/upstream.yml` through `mmctl plugin install-url --force`; one without it falls back to `mmctl plugin marketplace install`. The entry is then enabled and its per-addon hook in `tasks/addons/` runs. Every entry is `required: false`, so a refused install emits a warning and the deploy continues."
msgstr "`meta/addons/` erklærer de kurerede opstrømsplugins. `tasks/04_addons.yml` loops de poster, hvis `enabled` løser sandt og hænder hver til `tasks/utils/addon.yml`, som falder indgange denne node arkitektur kan ikke køre og passerer resten til `tasks/utils/addon/runnable.yml`. En indgang med en `config.archive` er installeret af `tasks/utils/addon/upstream.yml` gennem `mmctl plugin install-url --force`; en uden det falder tilbage til `mmctl plugin marketplace install`. Indgangen er derefter aktiveret og dens per- addon krog i `tasks/addons/` Løber. Hver indgang er `required: false`, så en nægtet installation udsender en advarsel og deployeringen fortsætter."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`meta/addons/` declares the integrations GitLab serves from the application itself. Every entry is `required: false` and follows the service flag of its bridged partner, so it is off unless that partner is part of the deployment — except where the partner is end of life, in which case the flag is a literal `false` that no inventory can turn on. Nothing is installed at deploy time; an administrator activates the integration per project or instance-wide, and `files/playwright/addons/<id>.spec.js` asserts the surface it is configured on."
msgstr "`meta/addons/` erklærer integreringerne GitLab tjener fra selve ansøgningen. Hver indgang er `required: false` og følger sin briggede partners tjenesteflag, så det er slukket, medmindre denne partner er en del af deployeringen - undtagen hvis partneren er død, i hvilket tilfælde flaget er en bogstavelig `false` at ingen lagerbeholdning kan tændes. Der er ikke installeret noget på implementeringstidspunktet; en administrator aktiverer integrationen pr. projekt eller instance- wide, og `files/playwright/addons/<id>.spec.js` hævder den overflade, den er indstillet på."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`meta/addons/` is also the download list: `MEDIAWIKI_EXT_ENABLED` keeps only the addons whose `enabled` resolves true, so a deployment without the matching service never pulls that tarball or runs composer for it."
msgstr "`meta/addons/` er også downloadlisten: `MEDIAWIKI_EXT_ENABLED` holder kun addons hvis `enabled` løser sandt, så en implementering uden matching service aldrig trækker at tarball eller kører komponist for det."

