# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`meta/csp.yml` declares `connect-src.wss` and `worker-src.blob` under `flags`, which renders them as the quoted keywords `'wss'` and `'blob'`. The browser console of every page reports `The source list for the Content Security Policy directive 'connect-src' contains an invalid source: ''wss''. It will be ignored.` and the same for `'blob'` in `worker-src`, and in a conference `Creating a worker from 'blob:https://meet.<domain>/…' violates the following Content Security Policy directive: \"worker-src 'self' 'blob'\"`, followed by an `e2ee:E2EEContext` worker error (measured on the compose stack with `sso` disabled). Cause: flags are for keyword sources such as `unsafe-inline`, scheme sources need their colon. Options: declare both as whitelist entries (`\"wss:\"` under `connect-src`, `\"blob:\"` under `worker-src`), as `roles/web-app-nextcloud/meta/csp.yml` does for `blob:`."
msgstr "`meta/csp.yml` erklærer `connect-src.wss` og `worker-src.blob` under `flags`, der gør dem som de citerede søgeord `'wss'` og `'blob'`. Browserkonsollen af hver side rapporter `The source list for the Content Security Policy directive 'connect-src' contains an invalid source: ''wss''. It will be ignored.` og det samme for `'blob'` til `worker-src`, og på en konference `Creating a worker from 'blob:https://meet.<domain>/…' violates the following Content Security Policy directive: \"worker-src 'self' 'blob'\"`, efterfulgt af en `e2ee:E2EEContext` Arbejdstagerfejl (målt på komponentstakken med `sso` deaktiveret). Årsag: flag er for søgeord kilder såsom `unsafe-inline`, ordningen kilder har brug for deres tyktarm. Indstillinger: Erklærer både som whitelist- indgange (`\"wss:\"` under `connect-src`, `\"blob:\"` under `worker-src`), som `roles/web-app-nextcloud/meta/csp.yml` gør for `blob:`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`meta/csp.yml` grants `unsafe-eval` for `script-src`: Knockout compiles every `data-bind` attribute with `new Function`, and without the grant the Knockout forms of the admin stay empty (\"Unable to parse bindings\", measured on the code form at `tfa/google/auth`). The grant covers the storefront too, which runs the same Knockout components. Open for the role's owner: keep it, or serve the admin under a policy of its own."
msgstr "`meta/csp.yml` tilskud `unsafe-eval` til `script-src`: Knockout kompilerer hver `data-bind` attribut med `new Function`, og uden tilskud Knockout former af admin forblive tom (\"Kan ikke fortolke bindinger\", målt på kodeformularen ved `tfa/google/auth`). Tilskuddet dækker også butiksfronten, som kører de samme Knockout komponenter. Åbn for rollens ejer: holde det, eller tjene admin under en politik af sin egen."

