msgid "`services.s1.flavor` selects which implementation answers that contract. `laya` runs [Laya](https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya), the default; `torch` and `onnx` run [jeff](https://github.com/logan-markewich/jeff) over a GLiFormer encoder, which is what the role carried before. Neither upstream ships a container image, so the role builds one and bakes the checkpoints into it. Baking keeps the deploy free of a download at container start, which is the failure mode a sibling role's model pull already hit."
msgstr "`services.s1.flavor` udvælger, hvilken gennemførelse der svarer på kontrakten. `laya` runs [Laya](https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya), misligholdelse `torch` og `onnx` run [Jeff](https://github.com/logan-markewich/jeff) over en GLiOter encoder, som er, hvad den rolle, der havde før. Hverken opstrøms sender et containerbillede, så rollen bygger en og bager checkpoints i det. Bagning holder deployeringen fri for en download ved containerstart, som er den fejltilstand en søskende rolles model pull allerede ramt."

