msgid "`svc-ai-robot` stays out of the platform list. It runs the same agent in embodied mode, which means it drops the isolating runtime on purpose and hands the container the host devices it is meant to drive. A broker platform is defined by the opposite: `runsc`, no host device, no host mount. Serving an embodied agent per user would either break that invariant or ship a robot that cannot reach its hardware."
msgstr "`svc-ai-robot` forbliver ude af platformlisten. Det kører samme agent i legemlig tilstand, hvilket betyder, at det falder isolerende runtime med vilje og hænder beholderen vært enheder det er beregnet til at køre. En mægler platform er defineret ved det modsatte: `runsc`, ingen vært enhed, ingen vært mount. At tjene en indbygget agent per bruger ville enten bryde den invariant eller sende en robot, der ikke kan nå sin hardware."

