msgid "`tenant` MUST be passed for tenant-aware per-tenant roles, MUST NOT be passed for global-scope roles or non-tenant apps."
msgstr "`tenant` MÅ ANVENDES for tenant- aware per- leader roller, MÅ IKKE ANVENDES for global-scope roller eller ikke-leader apps."

