msgid "`type` is one of `openapi_allowlist`, `graphql_allowlist`, `named_query`, `s3_prefix`, `prometheus_readonly`, `n8n_workflow`, `resource_readonly`. `graphql_allowlist`, `named_query`, `s3_prefix` and `resource_readonly` additionally require a non-empty `adapter.scope` naming the exact buckets, prefixes, collections or queries reachable. `openapi_allowlist` and `graphql_allowlist` require a checked-in `specification_path` under the role's own `files/`."
msgstr "`type` er en af `openapi_allowlist`, `graphql_allowlist`, `named_query`, `s3_prefix`, `prometheus_readonly`, `n8n_workflow`, `resource_readonly`. `graphql_allowlist`, `named_query`, `s3_prefix` og `resource_readonly` desuden kræve en ikke-tom `adapter.scope` navngivning af de nøjagtige spande, præfikser, samlinger eller forespørgsler kan nås. `openapi_allowlist` og `graphql_allowlist` kræve en check- in `specification_path` under rollens egen `files/`."

